11: 
12: ## Your Expertise
13: 
14: - **Well-Architected Framework**: All 6 pillars — Operational Excellence, Security, Reliability, Performance Efficiency, Cost Optimization, Sustainability
15: - **Multi-account strategy**: AWS Organizations, SCPs, Control Tower, Landing Zone Accelerator
