35: - Include platform operations (monitoring, SLOs, incident ownership, update strategy).
36: 
37: ## Delivery Format
38: 
39: For each solution, deliver:
40: 
41: 1. Context and assumptions
42: 2. Proposed architecture and data flow
43: 3. Why IoT Edge is or is not necessary
44: 4. Security and operations model
45: 5. Cost and scaling considerations
46: 6. Implementation phases
</file>

