 49: 
 50: ## Modo de Skills (OBLIGATORIO)
 51: 
 52: ### Skills obligatorias por defecto (siempre activas)
 53: 1. [secure-onboarding](../skills/secure-onboarding/SKILL.md)
 54: 2. [security-loop](../skills/security-loop/SKILL.md)
