 486: ## Headers Anti-Patterns (H1-H8)
 487: 
 488: ### H1: Missing Content-Security-Policy
 489: 
 490: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 491: - **Detection**: Absence of `Content-Security-Policy` header
 492: - **OWASP**: A02
 493: 
 494: ### H2: CSP with unsafe-inline and unsafe-eval
 495: 
 496: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 497: - **Detection**: `Content-Security-Policy.*(?:'unsafe-inline'|'unsafe-eval')`
 498: - **OWASP**: A02
 499: 
 500: Use nonce-based CSP: `script-src 'self' 'nonce-{SERVER_GENERATED}'`
 501: 
 502: ### H3: Missing Strict-Transport-Security
 503: 
 504: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 505: - **Detection**: Absence of `Strict-Transport-Security` header
 506: - **OWASP**: A02
 507: 
 508: Value: `max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload`
 509: 
 510: ### H4: Missing X-Content-Type-Options
 511: 
 512: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 513: - **Detection**: Absence of `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`
 514: - **OWASP**: A02
 515: 
 516: ### H5: Missing X-Frame-Options
 517: 
 518: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 519: - **Detection**: Absence of `X-Frame-Options` header
 520: - **OWASP**: A02
 521: 
 522: Value: `DENY`. Also set `Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'`.
 523: 
 524: ### H6: Permissive Referrer-Policy
 525: 
 526: - **Severity**: SUGGESTION
 527: - **Detection**: `Referrer-Policy.*(?:unsafe-url|no-referrer-when-downgrade)`
 528: - **OWASP**: A02
 529: 
 530: Use: `strict-origin-when-cross-origin`
 531: 
 532: ### H7: Missing Permissions-Policy
 533: 
 534: - **Severity**: SUGGESTION
 535: - **Detection**: Absence of `Permissions-Policy` header
 536: - **OWASP**: A02
 537: 
 538: Value: `camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()`
 539: 
 540: ### H8: CORS Wildcard with Credentials
 541: 
 542: - **Severity**: CRITICAL
 543: - **Detection**: `(?:cors|Access-Control-Allow-Origin).*\*`
 544: - **OWASP**: A02
 545: 
 546: ```typescript
 547: // GOOD
 548: app.use(cors({
 549:   origin: ['https://app.example.com', 'https://staging.example.com'],
 550:   credentials: true,
 551: }));
 552: ```
