 556: ## Frontend Anti-Patterns (FE1-FE8)
 557: 
 558: ### FE1: Unsanitized HTML Rendering
 559: 
 560: - **Severity**: CRITICAL
 561: - **Detection**: `(?:innerHTML|v-html|dangerouslySetInner)` without DOMPurify
 562: - **OWASP**: A05
 563: 
 564: Always sanitize with DOMPurify before rendering user-controlled HTML. See I4.
 565: 
 566: ### FE2: Dynamic Code Evaluation with User Input
 567: 
 568: - **Severity**: CRITICAL
 569: - **Detection**: `eval\s*\(`
 570: - **OWASP**: A05
 571: 
 572: Use structured data parsers (JSON.parse) instead.
 573: 
 574: ### FE3: postMessage Without Origin Validation
 575: 
 576: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 577: - **Detection**: `addEventListener\s*\(\s*['"]message['"].*(?!.*origin)`
 578: - **OWASP**: A01
 579: 
 580: ```typescript
 581: window.addEventListener('message', (event) => {
 582:   if (event.origin !== 'https://trusted.example.com') return;
 583:   processData(event.data);
 584: });
 585: ```
 586: 
 587: ### FE4: Prototype Pollution
 588: 
 589: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 590: - **Detection**: `(?:__proto__|constructor\.prototype|Object\.assign)\s*.*(?:req\.|body\.|query\.)`
 591: - **OWASP**: A05
 592: 
 593: Validate and filter keys from user input before merging into objects.
 594: 
 595: ### FE5: Open Redirect
 596: 
 597: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 598: - **Detection**: `(?:window\.location|location\.href|router\.push)\s*=\s*(?:req\.|params\.|query\.)`
 599: - **OWASP**: A01
 600: 
 601: ```typescript
 602: // GOOD — relative paths only
 603: const redirect = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('redirect');
 604: if (redirect?.startsWith('/') && !redirect.startsWith('//')) {
 605:   window.location.href = redirect;
 606: }
 607: ```
 608: 
 609: ### FE6: Sensitive Data in localStorage
 610: 
 611: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 612: - **Detection**: `localStorage\.setItem\(.*(?:token|session|credit|ssn|password)`
 613: - **OWASP**: A07
 614: 
 615: Use httpOnly cookies for tokens.
 616: 
 617: ### FE7: Missing CSRF Token
 618: 
 619: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 620: - **Detection**: POST/PUT/DELETE forms without CSRF token or SameSite cookie
 621: - **OWASP**: A01
 622: 
 623: Use double-submit cookie or synchronizer token. Next.js Server Actions have built-in CSRF via Origin header.
 624: 
 625: ### FE8: Client-Only Input Validation
 626: 
 627: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 628: - **Detection**: Form validation only in frontend
 629: - **OWASP**: A05
 630: 
 631: ALWAYS validate on server too. Use zod, joi, or class-validator.
