111: ### Databases
112: 
113: | Resource | Abbr | Scope | Length | Valid Characters | Example |
114: |----------|------|-------|--------|-----------------|---------|
115: | Azure SQL server | `sql` | global | 1-63 | Lowercase letters, numbers, hyphens. Can't start/end with hyphen. | `sql-navigator-prod-001` |
116: | Azure SQL database | `sqldb` | SQL server | 1-128 | Can't use: `<>*%&:\/?` | `sqldb-navigator-prod` |
