180: ---
181: 
182: ## Resources That Do NOT Allow Hyphens
183: 
184: These resources require concatenated lowercase alphanumerics (no separators):
185: 
186: | Resource | Abbr | Pattern |
187: |----------|------|---------|
188: | Storage account | `st` | `st{workload}{env}{instance}` → `stnavigatorprod001` |
189: | Container registry | `cr` | `cr{workload}{env}{instance}` → `crnavigatorprod001` |
190: | Azure Data Explorer cluster | `dec` | `dec{workload}{env}` → `decnavigatorprod` |
191: 
192: ---
193: 
194: ## Examples (CAF)
195: 
196: ```
197: # Management
198: rg-navigator-prod
199: rg-webapp-database-dev
200: 
201: # Networking
202: vnet-shared-eastus2-001
203: snet-shared-eastus2-001
204: nsg-weballow-001
205: pip-dc1-shared-eastus2-001
206: lbe-navigator-prod-001
207: 
208: # Compute
209: vm-sql-test-001
210: vm-sharepoint-dev-001
211: vmss-navigator-prod-001
212: asp-navigator-prod-001
213: app-navigator-prod-001
214: func-navigator-prod-001
215: 
216: # Containers
217: aks-navigator-prod-001
218: ca-navigator-prod-001
219: cae-navigator-prod-001
220: crnavigatorprod001        # no hyphens!
221: 
222: # Databases
223: sql-navigator-prod-001
224: sqldb-navigator-prod
225: cosmos-navigator-prod
226: psql-navigator-prod-001
227: 
228: # Storage / Security
229: stnavigatorprod001        # no hyphens!
230: kv-navigator-prod-001
231: id-navigator-prod-001
232: 
233: # Integration
234: apim-navigator-prod
235: sbns-navigator-prod
236: evhns-navigator-prod
237: 
238: # Monitoring
239: log-navigator-prod-001
240: appi-navigator-prod-001
241: 
242: # AI
243: oai-navigator-prod
244: srch-navigator-prod
245: ```
246: 
247: ---
248: 
249: ## Do NOT Do
250: 
251: - Do not use underscores unless the resource type requires it — use hyphens.
252: - Do not spell out the full resource type word (e.g., `storageaccount-myapp` → use `stmyapp001`).
253: - Do not use uppercase letters (resources are case-insensitive; lowercase is the convention).
254: - Do not include sensitive data (subscription ID, tenant ID, passwords) in names.
255: - Do not skip the environment segment — even for production.
256: - Do not use `#` — it breaks URL parsing in Azure Resource Manager.
257: - Do not use reserved words or trademarks in names for resources with public endpoints.
258: - Do not use more than two consecutive hyphens (e.g., `app--prod` is invalid).
