 324: ## Authorization Anti-Patterns (AZ1-AZ6)
 325: 
 326: ### AZ1: Missing Auth Middleware on New Endpoints
 327: 
 328: - **Severity**: CRITICAL
 329: - **Detection**: `(?:app|router)\.\w+\s*\(\s*['"]\/api\/(?:admin|users|settings)`
 330: - **OWASP**: A01
 331: 
 332: ```typescript
 333: // BAD
 334: router.delete('/api/users/:id', deleteUser);
 335: 
 336: // GOOD
 337: router.delete('/api/users/:id', authenticate, authorize('admin'), deleteUser);
 338: ```
 339: 
 340: ### AZ2: Client-Side Only Authorization
 341: 
 342: - **Severity**: CRITICAL
 343: - **Detection**: Component guards without server-side checks
 344: - **OWASP**: A01
 345: 
 346: Frontend guards are UX only. ALWAYS verify on server.
 347: 
 348: ### AZ3: IDOR (Insecure Direct Object Reference)
 349: 
 350: - **Severity**: CRITICAL
 351: - **Detection**: `params\.(?:id|userId|orderId)` without ownership check
 352: - **OWASP**: A01
 353: 
 354: ```typescript
 355: // GOOD — verify ownership
 356: router.get('/api/orders/:orderId', authenticate, async (req, res) => {
 357:   const order = await Order.findById(req.params.orderId);
 358:   if (!order || order.userId !== req.user.id) {
 359:     return res.status(404).json({ error: 'Not found' });
 360:   }
 361:   res.json(order);
 362: });
 363: ```
 364: 
 365: ### AZ4: Mass Assignment
 366: 
 367: - **Severity**: CRITICAL
 368: - **Detection**: `(?:create|update|findOneAndUpdate)\s*\(\s*req\.body\s*\)`
 369: - **OWASP**: A01
 370: 
 371: ```typescript
 372: // BAD
 373: await User.findByIdAndUpdate(id, req.body);
 374: 
 375: // GOOD — explicitly pick allowed fields
 376: const { name, email, avatar } = req.body;
 377: await User.findByIdAndUpdate(id, { name, email, avatar });
 378: ```
 379: 
 380: ### AZ5: Privilege Escalation via Role Parameter
 381: 
 382: - **Severity**: CRITICAL
 383: - **Detection**: `req\.body\.role|req\.body\.isAdmin|req\.body\.permissions`
 384: - **OWASP**: A01
 385: 
 386: ```typescript
 387: // GOOD — ignore role from input
 388: const { name, email, password } = req.body;
 389: const user = await User.create({ name, email, password, role: 'user' });
 390: ```
 391: 
 392: ### AZ6: Missing Re-Authentication for Sensitive Operations
 393: 
 394: - **Severity**: IMPORTANT
 395: - **Detection**: `(?:delete|destroy|remove).*(?:account|user|organization)` without re-auth
 396: - **OWASP**: A01
 397: 
 398: Require current password before account deletion, email change, or other sensitive operations.
 399: 
