 2: 
 3: ## Objective
 4: Create a robust initial design-system baseline with accessibility constraints.
 5: 
 6: ## Prompt
 7: ```text
 8: @design-system-architect crea baseline de design system para mi producto.
 9: Incluye paleta semantica, tipografia, spacing/radius/shadows, patrones obligatorios y compatibilidad light/dark.
10: Aplica guardrails WCAG AA y marca riesgos de cumplimiento.
11: ```
12: 
13: ## Expected Output
14: - Token baseline recommendations.
15: - Missing-token risk list.
16: - Next actions to persist in docs/design-tokens.
</file>

