231: ## Edge Style Keys
232: 
233: | Key | Values | Description |
234: | ----- | -------- | ------------- |
235: | `edgeStyle` | see below | Connection routing algorithm |
236: | `rounded` | `0`/`1` | Rounded corners on orthogonal edges |
237: | `curved` | `0`/`1` | Curved line segments |
238: | `orthogonal` | `0`/`1` | Force orthogonal routing |
239: | `jettySize` | `auto`/integer | Source/target jet size |
240: | `exitX` | 0.0–1.0 | Source exit point X (0=left, 0.5=center, 1=right) |
241: | `exitY` | 0.0–1.0 | Source exit point Y (0=top, 0.5=center, 1=bottom) |
242: | `exitDx` | float | Source exit X offset (px) |
243: | `exitDy` | float | Source exit Y offset (px) |
244: | `entryX` | 0.0–1.0 | Target entry point X |
245: | `entryY` | 0.0–1.0 | Target entry point Y |
246: | `entryDx` | float | Target entry X offset (px) |
247: | `entryDy` | float | Target entry Y offset (px) |
248: | `endArrow` | see Arrow Types | Arrow head at target |
249: | `startArrow` | see Arrow Types | Arrow tail at source |
250: | `endFill` | `0`/`1` | Filled end arrow head |
251: | `startFill` | `0`/`1` | Filled start arrow head |
252: | `endSize` | integer | End arrow head size (px) |
253: | `startSize` | integer | Start arrow head size (px) |
254: | `labelBackgroundColor` | `#hex`/`none` | Label background fill |
255: | `labelBorderColor` | `#hex`/`none` | Label border color |
