263: | `elbowEdgeStyle` | Single elbow | Clean directional diagrams |
264: | `entityRelationEdgeStyle` | ER-style routing | ER diagrams |
265: | `segmentEdgeStyle` | Segmented with handles | Fine-tuned routing |
266: | `isometricEdgeStyle` | Isometric grid | Isometric diagrams |
