 15: ## 1. Changelog Format
 16: 
 17: Keep a `CHANGELOG.md` following [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/) conventions.
 18: Every PR should update the `[Unreleased]` section. Before releasing, move those entries to a
 19: new version section with the date.
 20: 
 21: ```markdown
 22: # Changelog
 23: 
 24: All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
 25: 
 26: The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),
 27: and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).
