23: | Data Factory | https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/templates/microsoft.datafactory/factories |
24: | Application Insights | https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/templates/microsoft.insights/components |
25: | ML Workspace (Hub) | https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/templates/microsoft.machinelearningservices/workspaces |
