 67: ## Diagram Hierarchy — Displaying Multiple Subscriptions/RGs
 68: 
 69: **Single subscription + single RG**: Same as before (VNet boundary only)
 70: **Multiple RGs (same subscription)**: Dashed boundary per RG
 71: **Multiple subscriptions**: Two-level boundary of Subscription > RG
 72: 
 73: Pass hierarchy information in the diagram JSON:
 74: 
 75: **Add `subscription` and `resourceGroup` fields to the services JSON:**
 76: ```json
 77: {
 78:   "id": "foundry",
 79:   "name": "foundry-xxx",
 80:   "type": "ai_foundry",
 81:   "subscription": "sub-002",
 82:   "resourceGroup": "rg-prod",
