389: | User Request | Clarifying Question Example |
390: |---|---|
391: | "It's slow" / "Response takes too long" | "Which service is slow? Should we upgrade the SKU or change the region?" |
392: | "I want to increase throughput" | "Which service's throughput should we increase? Scale out? Increase DTU/RU?" |
393: | "AI Search indexing is slow" | "Should we add partitions? Upgrade the SKU to S2?" |
394: 
395: **💰 Cost**
396: 
397: | User Request | Clarifying Question Example |
398: |---|---|
399: | "I want to reduce costs" | "Which service's cost should we reduce? SKU downgrade? Clean up unused resources?" |
400: | "How much does this cost?" | Look up pricing info from MS Docs and provide estimated cost based on current SKUs |
401: | "It's a dev environment, so make it cheap" | "Should we switch to Free/Basic tiers? Which services?" |
