403: **🔒 Security**
404: 
405: | User Request | Clarifying Question Example |
406: |---|---|
407: | "Harden the security" | "Should we add PEs to services that don't have them? Check RBAC? Disable publicNetworkAccess?" |
408: | "Block public access" | "Should we apply PE + publicNetworkAccess: Disabled to all services?" |
409: | "Manage the keys" | "Should we add Key Vault and connect it with Managed Identity?" |
410: 
411: **🌐 Network**
412: 
413: | User Request | Clarifying Question Example |
414: |---|---|
415: | "Add PE" | "To which service? Should we add them to all services at once?" |
416: | "Separate the VNet" | "Which subnets should we separate? Should we also add NSGs?" |
417: | "Add Bastion" | "Adding Azure Bastion for VM access. Please specify the subnet CIDR." |
