423: | "Add a VM" | "How many? What SKU? Same VNet? What OS?" |
424: | "Add Fabric" | "What SKU? What's the admin email?" |
425: | "Delete this" | "Are you sure you want to remove [resource name]? Connected PEs will also be removed." |
