429: | User Request | Clarifying Question Example |
430: |---|---|
431: | "I want to see logs" | "Should we add a Log Analytics Workspace and connect Diagnostic Settings?" |
432: | "Set up alerts" | "For which metrics? CPU? Error rate? Response time?" |
433: | "Attach Application Insights" | "To which service? App Service? Function App?" |
