 23: | **Project Type** | {azd-project | standalone-bicep} |
 24: | **Deployment Scope** | {resourceGroup | subscription | managementGroup | tenant} |
 25: | **Target** | {resource-group-name | subscription-name | mg-id} |
 26: | **Validation Level** | {Provider | ProviderNoRbac} |
 27: 
 28: ### Validation Results
 29: 
 30: | Check | Status | Details |
 31: |-------|--------|---------|
 32: | Bicep Syntax | {✅ Pass | ❌ Fail | ⚠️ Warnings | ⏭️ Skipped} | {details} |
 33: | What-If Analysis | {✅ Pass | ❌ Fail | ⏭️ Skipped} | {details} |
 34: | Permission Check | {✅ Pass | ⚠️ Limited | ❌ Fail} | {details} |
 35: 
 36: ---
 37: 
 38: ## Tools Executed
 39: 
 40: ### Commands Run
 41: 
 42: | Step | Command | Exit Code | Duration |
 43: |------|---------|-----------|----------|
 44: | 1 | `{command}` | {0 | non-zero} | {duration} |
 45: | 2 | `{command}` | {0 | non-zero} | {duration} |
 46: 
 47: ### Tool Versions
 48: 
 49: | Tool | Version |
 50: |------|---------|
 51: | Azure CLI | {version} |
 52: | Bicep CLI | {version} |
 53: | Azure Developer CLI | {version-or-n/a} |
 54: 
 55: ---
 56: 
 57: ## Issues
 58: 
 59: {if-no-issues}
