 97: ### Change Summary
 98: 
 99: | Change Type | Count |
100: |-------------|-------|
101: | 🆕 Create | {count} |
102: | 📝 Modify | {count} |
103: | 🗑️ Delete | {count} |
104: | ✓ No Change | {count} |
105: | ⚠️ Ignore | {count} |
