123: 
124: | Property | Current Value | New Value |
125: |----------|---------------|-----------|
126: | {property-path} | {current} | {new} |
127: 
128: {end-if}
129: 
130: {if-no-resources-to-modify}
131: *No resources will be modified.*
132: {end-if}
133: 
134: ### Resources to Delete
135: 
136: {if-resources-to-delete}
137: | Resource Type | Resource Name |
138: |---------------|---------------|
139: | {type} | {name} |
140: 
141: > ⚠️ **Warning:** Resources listed for deletion will be permanently removed.
142: {end-if}
