167: 
168: ## Next Steps
169: 
170: {if-all-passed}
171: The preflight validation passed. You can proceed with deployment:
172: 
173: **For azd projects:**
174: ```bash
175: azd provision
176: # or
177: azd up
178: ```
179: 
180: **For standalone Bicep:**
181: ```bash
182: az deployment group create \
183:   --resource-group {rg-name} \
184:   --template-file {bicep-file} \
185:   --parameters {param-file}
186: ```
187: {end-if}
188: 
189: {if-issues-exist}
