193: 2. Proceed with deployment once all checks pass
194: {end-if}
195: 
196: ---
197: 
198: *Report generated by Azure Deployment Preflight Skill*
199: ```
200: 
201: ---
202: 
203: ## Status Values
204: 
205: ### Overall Status
206: 
207: | Status | Meaning | Visual |
208: |--------|---------|--------|
209: | **Pass** | All checks succeeded, safe to deploy | ✅ |
210: | **Pass with Warnings** | Checks succeeded but review warnings | ⚠️ |
211: | **Fail** | One or more checks failed | ❌ |
212: 
213: ### Individual Check Status
214: 
215: | Status | Meaning |
216: |--------|---------|
217: | ✅ Pass | Check completed successfully |
218: | ❌ Fail | Check found errors |
219: | ⚠️ Warnings | Check passed with warnings |
220: | ⏭️ Skipped | Check was skipped (tool unavailable, etc.) |
221: 
222: ---
223: 
224: ## Example Report
225: 
