<file path=".github/skills/mcpee-boost-mcpee-cloud/skills/azure-deployment-preflight/references/VALIDATION-COMMANDS.md">
  1: # Validation Commands Reference
  2: 
  3: This reference documents all commands used for Azure deployment preflight validation.
  4: 
  5: ## Azure Developer CLI (azd)
  6: 
  7: ### azd provision --preview
  8: 
  9: Preview infrastructure changes for azd projects without deploying.
 10: 
 11: ```bash
 12: azd provision --preview [options]
 13: ```
 14: 
 15: **Options:**
 16: | Option | Description |
 17: |--------|-------------|
 18: | `--environment`, `-e` | Name of the environment to use |
 19: | `--no-prompt` | Accept defaults without prompting |
 20: | `--debug` | Enable debug logging |
 21: | `--cwd` | Set working directory |
 22: 
 23: **Examples:**
 24: 
 25: ```bash
 26: # Preview with default environment
 27: azd provision --preview
 28: 
 29: # Preview specific environment
 30: azd provision --preview --environment dev
 31: 
 32: # Preview without prompts (CI/CD)
 33: azd provision --preview --no-prompt
 34: ```
 35: 
 36: **Output:** Shows resources that will be created, modified, or deleted.
 37: 
 38: ### azd auth login
 39: 
 40: Authenticate to Azure for azd operations.
 41: 
 42: ```bash
 43: azd auth login [options]
 44: ```
 45: 
 46: **Options:**
 47: | Option | Description |
 48: |--------|-------------|
 49: | `--check-status` | Check login status without logging in |
 50: | `--use-device-code` | Use device code flow |
 51: | `--tenant-id` | Specify tenant |
 52: | `--client-id` | Service principal client ID |
 53: 
 54: ### azd env list
 55: 
 56: List available environments.
 57: 
 58: ```bash
 59: azd env list
 60: ```
 61: 
 62: ---
 63: 
 64: ## Azure CLI (az)
 65: 
 66: ### az deployment group what-if
 67: 
 68: Preview changes for resource group deployments.
 69: 
 70: ```bash
 71: az deployment group what-if \
 72:   --resource-group <rg-name> \
 73:   --template-file <bicep-file> \
 74:   [options]
 75: ```
 76: 
 77: **Required Parameters:**
 78: | Parameter | Description |
 79: |-----------|-------------|
 80: | `--resource-group`, `-g` | Target resource group name |
 81: | `--template-file`, `-f` | Path to Bicep file |
 82: 
 83: **Optional Parameters:**
 84: | Parameter | Description |
 85: |-----------|-------------|
 86: | `--parameters`, `-p` | Parameter file or inline values |
 87: | `--validation-level` | `Provider` (default), `ProviderNoRbac`, or `Template` |
 88: | `--result-format` | `FullResourcePayloads` (default) or `ResourceIdOnly` |
 89: | `--no-pretty-print` | Output raw JSON for parsing |
 90: | `--name`, `-n` | Deployment name |
 91: | `--exclude-change-types` | Exclude specific change types from output |
 92: 
 93: **Validation Levels:**
 94: | Level | Description | Use Case |
 95: |-------|-------------|----------|
 96: | `Provider` | Full validation with RBAC checks | Default, most thorough |
 97: | `ProviderNoRbac` | Full validation, read permissions only | When lacking deploy permissions |
 98: | `Template` | Static syntax validation only | Quick syntax check |
 99: 
100: **Examples:**
101: 
102: ```bash
103: # Basic what-if
104: az deployment group what-if \
105:   --resource-group my-rg \
106:   --template-file main.bicep
107: 
108: # With parameters and full validation
109: az deployment group what-if \
110:   --resource-group my-rg \
111:   --template-file main.bicep \
112:   --parameters main.bicepparam \
113:   --validation-level Provider
114: 
115: # Fallback without RBAC checks
116: az deployment group what-if \
117:   --resource-group my-rg \
118:   --template-file main.bicep \
119:   --validation-level ProviderNoRbac
120: 
121: # JSON output for parsing
122: az deployment group what-if \
123:   --resource-group my-rg \
124:   --template-file main.bicep \
125:   --no-pretty-print
126: ```
127: 
128: ### az deployment sub what-if
129: 
130: Preview changes for subscription-level deployments.
131: 
132: ```bash
133: az deployment sub what-if \
134:   --location <location> \
135:   --template-file <bicep-file> \
136:   [options]
137: ```
138: 
139: **Required Parameters:**
140: | Parameter | Description |
141: |-----------|-------------|
142: | `--location`, `-l` | Location for deployment metadata |
143: | `--template-file`, `-f` | Path to Bicep file |
144: 
145: **Examples:**
146: 
147: ```bash
148: az deployment sub what-if \
149:   --location eastus \
150:   --template-file main.bicep \
151:   --parameters main.bicepparam \
152:   --validation-level Provider
153: ```
154: 
155: ### az deployment mg what-if
156: 
157: Preview changes for management group deployments.
158: 
159: ```bash
160: az deployment mg what-if \
161:   --location <location> \
162:   --management-group-id <mg-id> \
163:   --template-file <bicep-file> \
164:   [options]
165: ```
166: 
167: **Required Parameters:**
168: | Parameter | Description |
169: |-----------|-------------|
170: | `--location`, `-l` | Location for deployment metadata |
171: | `--management-group-id`, `-m` | Target management group ID |
172: | `--template-file`, `-f` | Path to Bicep file |
173: 
174: ### az deployment tenant what-if
175: 
176: Preview changes for tenant-level deployments.
177: 
178: ```bash
179: az deployment tenant what-if \
180:   --location <location> \
181:   --template-file <bicep-file> \
182:   [options]
183: ```
184: 
185: **Required Parameters:**
186: | Parameter | Description |
187: |-----------|-------------|
188: | `--location`, `-l` | Location for deployment metadata |
189: | `--template-file`, `-f` | Path to Bicep file |
190: 
191: ### az login
192: 
193: Authenticate to Azure CLI.
194: 
195: ```bash
196: az login [options]
197: ```
198: 
199: **Options:**
200: | Option | Description |
201: |--------|-------------|
202: | `--tenant`, `-t` | Tenant ID or domain |
203: | `--use-device-code` | Use device code flow |
204: | `--service-principal` | Login as service principal |
205: 
206: ### az account show
207: 
208: Display current subscription context.
209: 
210: ```bash
211: az account show
212: ```
213: 
214: ### az group exists
215: 
216: Check if resource group exists.
217: 
218: ```bash
219: az group exists --name <rg-name>
220: ```
221: 
222: ---
223: 
224: ## Bicep CLI
225: 
226: ### bicep build
227: 
228: Compile Bicep to ARM JSON and validate syntax.
229: 
230: ```bash
231: bicep build <bicep-file> [options]
232: ```
233: 
234: **Options:**
235: | Option | Description |
236: |--------|-------------|
237: | `--stdout` | Output to stdout instead of file |
238: | `--outdir` | Output directory |
239: | `--outfile` | Output file path |
240: | `--no-restore` | Skip module restore |
241: 
242: **Examples:**
243: 
244: ```bash
245: # Validate syntax (output to stdout, no file created)
246: bicep build main.bicep --stdout > /dev/null
247: 
248: # Build to specific directory
249: bicep build main.bicep --outdir ./build
250: 
251: # Validate multiple files
252: for f in *.bicep; do bicep build "$f" --stdout; done
253: ```
254: 
255: **Error Output Format:**
256: ```
257: /path/to/file.bicep(22,51) : Error BCP064: Found unexpected tokens in interpolated expression.
258: /path/to/file.bicep(22,51) : Error BCP004: The string at this location is not terminated.
259: ```
260: 
261: Format: `<file>(<line>,<column>) : <severity> <code>: <message>`
262: 
263: ### bicep --version
264: 
265: Check Bicep CLI version.
266: 
267: ```bash
268: bicep --version
269: ```
270: 
271: ---
272: 
273: ## Parameter File Detection
274: 
275: ### Bicep Parameters (.bicepparam)
276: 
277: Modern Bicep parameter files (recommended):
278: 
279: ```bicep
280: using './main.bicep'
281: 
282: param location = 'eastus'
283: param environment = 'dev'
284: param tags = {
285:   environment: 'dev'
286:   project: 'myapp'
287: }
288: ```
289: 
290: **Detection pattern:** `<template-name>.bicepparam`
291: 
292: ### JSON Parameters (.parameters.json)
293: 
294: Traditional ARM parameter files:
295: 
296: ```json
297: {
298:   "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/schemas/2019-04-01/deploymentParameters.json#",
299:   "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
300:   "parameters": {
301:     "location": { "value": "eastus" },
302:     "environment": { "value": "dev" }
303:   }
304: }
305: ```
306: 
307: **Detection patterns:**
308: - `<template-name>.parameters.json`
309: - `parameters.json`
310: - `parameters/<env>.json`
311: 
312: ### Using Parameters with Commands
313: 
314: ```bash
315: # Bicep parameters file
316: az deployment group what-if \
317:   --resource-group my-rg \
318:   --template-file main.bicep \
319:   --parameters main.bicepparam
320: 
321: # JSON parameters file
322: az deployment group what-if \
323:   --resource-group my-rg \
324:   --template-file main.bicep \
325:   --parameters @parameters.json
326: 
327: # Inline parameter overrides
328: az deployment group what-if \
329:   --resource-group my-rg \
330:   --template-file main.bicep \
331:   --parameters main.bicepparam \
332:   --parameters location=westus
333: ```
334: 
335: ---
336: 
337: ## Determining Deployment Scope
338: 
339: Check the Bicep file's `targetScope` declaration:
340: 
341: ```bicep
342: // Resource Group (default if not specified)
343: targetScope = 'resourceGroup'
344: 
345: // Subscription
346: targetScope = 'subscription'
347: 
348: // Management Group
349: targetScope = 'managementGroup'
350: 
351: // Tenant
352: targetScope = 'tenant'
353: ```
354: 
355: **Scope to Command Mapping:**
356: 
357: | targetScope | Command | Required Parameters |
358: |-------------|---------|---------------------|
359: | `resourceGroup` | `az deployment group what-if` | `--resource-group` |
360: | `subscription` | `az deployment sub what-if` | `--location` |
361: | `managementGroup` | `az deployment mg what-if` | `--location`, `--management-group-id` |
362: | `tenant` | `az deployment tenant what-if` | `--location` |
363: 
364: ---
365: 
366: ## Version Requirements
367: 
368: | Tool | Minimum Version | Recommended Version | Key Features |
369: |------|-----------------|---------------------|--------------|
370: | Azure CLI | 2.14.0 | 2.76.0+ | `--validation-level` switch |
371: | Azure Developer CLI | 1.0.0 | Latest | `--preview` flag |
372: | Bicep CLI | 0.4.0 | Latest | Best error messages |
373: 
374: **Check versions:**
375: ```bash
376: az --version
377: azd version
378: bicep --version
379: ```
</file>

