161: | `--org` / `--organization` | Azure DevOps organization URL (e.g., `https://dev.azure.com/{org}`) |
162: | `--project` / `-p` | Project name or ID |
163: | `--detect` | Auto-detect organization from git config |
164: | `--yes` / `-y` | Skip confirmation prompts |
165: | `--open` | Open resource in web browser |
166: | `--subscription` | Azure subscription (for Azure resources) |
