250: 
251: ## Security Permissions
252: 
253: ### List Namespaces
254: 
255: ```bash
256: az devops security permission namespace list
257: ```
258: 
259: ### Show Namespace Details
260: 
261: ```bash
262: # Show permissions available in a namespace
263: az devops security permission namespace show --namespace "GitRepositories"
264: ```
265: 
266: ### List Permissions
267: 
268: ```bash
269: # List permissions for user/group and namespace
270: az devops security permission list \
271:   --id {user-or-group-id} \
272:   --namespace "GitRepositories" \
273:   --project {project}
274: 
275: # List for specific token (repository)
276: az devops security permission list \
277:   --id {user-or-group-id} \
278:   --namespace "GitRepositories" \
279:   --project {project} \
280:   --token "repoV2/{project}/{repository-id}"
281: ```
282: 
283: ### Show Permissions
284: 
285: ```bash
286: az devops security permission show \
287:   --id {user-or-group-id} \
288:   --namespace "GitRepositories" \
289:   --project {project} \
290:   --token "repoV2/{project}/{repository-id}"
291: ```
292: 
293: ### Update Permissions
294: 
295: ```bash
296: # Grant permission
297: az devops security permission update \
298:   --id {user-or-group-id} \
299:   --namespace "GitRepositories" \
300:   --project {project} \
301:   --token "repoV2/{project}/{repository-id}" \
302:   --permission-mask "Pull,Contribute"
303: 
304: # Deny permission
305: az devops security permission update \
306:   --id {user-or-group-id} \
307:   --namespace "GitRepositories" \
308:   --project {project} \
309:   --token "repoV2/{project}/{repository-id}" \
310:   --permission-mask 0
311: ```
312: 
313: ### Reset Permissions
314: 
315: ```bash
316: # Reset specific permission bits
317: az devops security permission reset \
318:   --id {user-or-group-id} \
319:   --namespace "GitRepositories" \
320:   --project {project} \
321:   --token "repoV2/{project}/{repository-id}" \
322:   --permission-mask "Pull,Contribute"
323: 
324: # Reset all permissions
325: az devops security permission reset-all \
326:   --id {user-or-group-id} \
327:   --namespace "GitRepositories" \
328:   --project {project} \
329:   --token "repoV2/{project}/{repository-id}" --yes
330: ```
331: 
332: ## Wikis
333: 
334: ### List Wikis
335: 
336: ```bash
337: # List all wikis in project
338: az devops wiki list --project {project}
339: 
340: # List all wikis in organization
341: az devops wiki list
342: ```
343: 
344: ### Show Wiki
345: 
346: ```bash
347: az devops wiki show --wiki {wiki-name} --project {project}
348: az devops wiki show --wiki {wiki-name} --project {project} --open
349: ```
350: 
351: ### Create Wiki
352: 
353: ```bash
354: # Create project wiki
355: az devops wiki create \
356:   --name {wiki-name} \
357:   --project {project} \
358:   --type projectWiki
359: 
360: # Create code wiki from repository
361: az devops wiki create \
362:   --name {wiki-name} \
363:   --project {project} \
364:   --type codeWiki \
365:   --repository {repo-name} \
366:   --mapped-path /wiki
367: ```
368: 
369: ### Delete Wiki
370: 
371: ```bash
372: az devops wiki delete --wiki {wiki-id} --project {project} --yes
373: ```
374: 
375: ### Wiki Pages
376: 
377: ```bash
378: # List pages
379: az devops wiki page list --wiki {wiki-name} --project {project}
380: 
381: # Show page
382: az devops wiki page show \
383:   --wiki {wiki-name} \
384:   --path "/page-name" \
385:   --project {project}
386: 
387: # Create page
388: az devops wiki page create \
389:   --wiki {wiki-name} \
390:   --path "/new-page" \
391:   --content "# New Page\n\nPage content here..." \
392:   --project {project}
393: 
394: # Update page
395: az devops wiki page update \
396:   --wiki {wiki-name} \
397:   --path "/existing-page" \
398:   --content "# Updated Page\n\nNew content..." \
399:   --project {project}
400: 
401: # Delete page
402: az devops wiki page delete \
403:   --wiki {wiki-name} \
404:   --path "/old-page" \
405:   --project {project} --yes
406: ```
407: 
408: ## Administration
409: 
410: ### Banner Management
411: 
412: ```bash
413: # List banners
414: az devops admin banner list
415: 
416: # Show banner details
417: az devops admin banner show --id {banner-id}
418: 
419: # Add new banner
420: az devops admin banner add \
421:   --message "System maintenance scheduled" \
422:   --level info  # info, warning, error
423: 
424: # Update banner
