 10: - [Universal Packages (Artifacts)](#universal-packages-artifacts)
 11: 
 12: ---
 13: 
 14: ## Pipelines
 15: 
 16: ### List Pipelines
 17: 
 18: ```bash
 19: az pipelines list --output table
 20: az pipelines list --query "[?name=='myPipeline']"
 21: az pipelines list --folder-path 'folder/subfolder'
 22: ```
 23: 
 24: ### Create Pipeline
 25: 
 26: ```bash
 27: # From local repository context (auto-detects settings)
 28: az pipelines create --name 'ContosoBuild' --description 'Pipeline for contoso project'
 29: 
 30: # With specific branch and YAML path
 31: az pipelines create \
 32:   --name {pipeline-name} \
 33:   --repository {repo} \
 34:   --branch main \
 35:   --yaml-path azure-pipelines.yml \
 36:   --description "My CI/CD pipeline"
 37: 
 38: # For GitHub repository
 39: az pipelines create \
 40:   --name 'GitHubPipeline' \
 41:   --repository https://github.com/Org/Repo \
 42:   --branch main \
 43:   --repository-type github
 44: 
 45: # Skip first run
 46: az pipelines create --name 'MyPipeline' --skip-run true
 47: ```
 48: 
 49: ### Show Pipeline
 50: 
 51: ```bash
 52: az pipelines show --id {pipeline-id}
 53: az pipelines show --name {pipeline-name}
 54: ```
 55: 
 56: ### Update Pipeline
 57: 
 58: ```bash
 59: az pipelines update --id {pipeline-id} --name "New name" --description "Updated description"
 60: ```
 61: 
 62: ### Delete Pipeline
 63: 
 64: ```bash
 65: az pipelines delete --id {pipeline-id} --yes
 66: ```
 67: 
 68: ### Run Pipeline
 69: 
 70: ```bash
 71: # Run by name
 72: az pipelines run --name {pipeline-name} --branch main
 73: 
 74: # Run by ID
 75: az pipelines run --id {pipeline-id} --branch refs/heads/main
 76: 
 77: # With parameters
 78: az pipelines run --name {pipeline-name} --parameters version=1.0.0 environment=prod
 79: 
 80: # With variables
 81: az pipelines run --name {pipeline-name} --variables buildId=123 configuration=release
 82: 
 83: # Open results in browser
 84: az pipelines run --name {pipeline-name} --open
 85: ```
 86: 
 87: ## Pipeline Runs
 88: 
 89: ### List Runs
 90: 
 91: ```bash
 92: az pipelines runs list --pipeline {pipeline-id}
 93: az pipelines runs list --name {pipeline-name} --top 10
 94: az pipelines runs list --branch main --status completed
 95: ```
 96: 
 97: ### Show Run Details
 98: 
 99: ```bash
100: az pipelines runs show --run-id {run-id}
101: az pipelines runs show --run-id {run-id} --open
102: ```
103: 
104: ### Pipeline Artifacts
105: 
106: ```bash
107: # List artifacts for a run
108: az pipelines runs artifact list --run-id {run-id}
109: 
110: # Download artifact
111: az pipelines runs artifact download \
112:   --artifact-name '{artifact-name}' \
113:   --path {local-path} \
114:   --run-id {run-id}
115: 
116: # Upload artifact
117: az pipelines runs artifact upload \
118:   --artifact-name '{artifact-name}' \
119:   --path {local-path} \
120:   --run-id {run-id}
121: ```
122: 
123: ### Pipeline Run Tags
124: 
125: ```bash
126: # Add tag to run
127: az pipelines runs tag add --run-id {run-id} --tags production v1.0
128: 
129: # List run tags
130: az pipelines runs tag list --run-id {run-id} --output table
131: ```
132: 
133: ## Builds
134: 
135: ### List Builds
136: 
137: ```bash
138: az pipelines build list
139: az pipelines build list --definition {build-definition-id}
140: az pipelines build list --status completed --result succeeded
141: ```
142: 
143: ### Queue Build
144: 
145: ```bash
146: az pipelines build queue --definition {build-definition-id} --branch main
147: az pipelines build queue --definition {build-definition-id} --parameters version=1.0.0
148: ```
149: 
150: ### Show Build Details
151: 
152: ```bash
153: az pipelines build show --id {build-id}
154: ```
155: 
156: ### Cancel Build
157: 
158: ```bash
159: az pipelines build cancel --id {build-id}
160: ```
161: 
162: ### Build Tags
163: 
164: ```bash
165: # Add tag to build
166: az pipelines build tag add --build-id {build-id} --tags prod release
167: 
168: # Delete tag from build
169: az pipelines build tag delete --build-id {build-id} --tag prod
170: ```
171: 
172: ## Build Definitions
173: 
174: ### List Build Definitions
175: 
176: ```bash
177: az pipelines build definition list
178: az pipelines build definition list --name {definition-name}
179: ```
180: 
181: ### Show Build Definition
182: 
183: ```bash
184: az pipelines build definition show --id {definition-id}
185: ```
186: 
187: ## Releases
188: 
189: ### List Releases
190: 
191: ```bash
192: az pipelines release list
193: az pipelines release list --definition {release-definition-id}
194: ```
195: 
196: ### Create Release
197: 
198: ```bash
199: az pipelines release create --definition {release-definition-id}
200: az pipelines release create --definition {release-definition-id} --description "Release v1.0"
201: ```
202: 
203: ### Show Release
204: 
205: ```bash
206: az pipelines release show --id {release-id}
207: ```
208: 
209: ## Release Definitions
210: 
211: ### List Release Definitions
212: 
213: ```bash
214: az pipelines release definition list
215: ```
216: 
217: ### Show Release Definition
218: 
219: ```bash
220: az pipelines release definition show --id {definition-id}
221: ```
222: 
223: ## Universal Packages (Artifacts)
224: 
225: ### Publish Package
226: 
227: ```bash
228: az artifacts universal publish \
229:   --feed {feed-name} \
230:   --name {package-name} \
231:   --version {version} \
232:   --path {package-path} \
233:   --project {project}
234: ```
235: 
236: ### Download Package
237: 
238: ```bash
239: az artifacts universal download \
240:   --feed {feed-name} \
241:   --name {package-name} \
242:   --version {version} \
243:   --path {download-path} \
244:   --project {project}
