  1: # Repositories & Pull Requests
  2: 
  3: ## Table of Contents
  4: - [Repositories](#repositories)
  5: - [Repository Import](#repository-import)
  6: - [Pull Requests](#pull-requests)
  7: - [Git References](#git-references)
  8: - [Repository Policies](#repository-policies)
  9: 
 10: ---
 11: 
 12: ## Repositories
 13: 
 14: ### List Repositories
 15: 
 16: ```bash
 17: az repos list --org https://dev.azure.com/{org} --project {project}
 18: az repos list --output table
 19: ```
 20: 
 21: ### Show Repository Details
 22: 
 23: ```bash
 24: az repos show --repository {repo-name} --project {project}
 25: ```
 26: 
 27: ### Create Repository
 28: 
 29: ```bash
 30: az repos create --name {repo-name} --project {project}
 31: ```
 32: 
 33: ### Delete Repository
 34: 
 35: ```bash
 36: az repos delete --id {repo-id} --project {project} --yes
 37: ```
 38: 
 39: ### Update Repository
 40: 
 41: ```bash
 42: az repos update --id {repo-id} --name {new-name} --project {project}
 43: ```
 44: 
 45: ## Repository Import
 46: 
 47: ### Import Git Repository
 48: 
 49: ```bash
 50: # Import from public Git repository
 51: az repos import create \
 52:   --git-source-url https://github.com/user/repo \
 53:   --repository {repo-name}
 54: 
 55: # Import with authentication
 56: az repos import create \
 57:   --git-source-url https://github.com/user/private-repo \
 58:   --repository {repo-name} \
 59:   --user {username} \
 60:   --password {password-or-pat}
 61: ```
 62: 
 63: ## Pull Requests
 64: 
 65: ### Create Pull Request
 66: 
 67: ```bash
 68: # Basic PR creation
 69: az repos pr create \
 70:   --repository {repo} \
 71:   --source-branch {source-branch} \
 72:   --target-branch {target-branch} \
 73:   --title "PR Title" \
 74:   --description "PR description" \
 75:   --open
 76: 
 77: # PR with work items
 78: az repos pr create \
 79:   --repository {repo} \
 80:   --source-branch {source-branch} \
 81:   --work-items 63 64
 82: 
 83: # Draft PR with reviewers
 84: az repos pr create \
 85:   --repository {repo} \
 86:   --source-branch feature/new-feature \
 87:   --target-branch main \
 88:   --title "Feature: New functionality" \
 89:   --draft true \
 90:   --reviewers user1@example.com user2@example.com \
 91:   --required-reviewers lead@example.com \
 92:   --labels "enhancement" "backlog"
 93: ```
 94: 
 95: ### List Pull Requests
 96: 
 97: ```bash
 98: # All PRs
 99: az repos pr list --repository {repo}
100: 
101: # Filter by status
102: az repos pr list --repository {repo} --status active
103: 
104: # Filter by creator
105: az repos pr list --repository {repo} --creator {email}
106: 
107: # Output as table
108: az repos pr list --repository {repo} --output table
109: ```
110: 
111: ### Show PR Details
112: 
113: ```bash
114: az repos pr show --id {pr-id}
115: az repos pr show --id {pr-id} --open  # Open in browser
116: ```
117: 
118: ### Update PR (Complete/Abandon/Draft)
119: 
120: ```bash
121: # Complete PR
122: az repos pr update --id {pr-id} --status completed
123: 
124: # Abandon PR
125: az repos pr update --id {pr-id} --status abandoned
126: 
127: # Set to draft
128: az repos pr update --id {pr-id} --draft true
129: 
130: # Publish draft PR
131: az repos pr update --id {pr-id} --draft false
132: 
133: # Auto-complete when policies pass
134: az repos pr update --id {pr-id} --auto-complete true
135: 
136: # Set title and description
137: az repos pr update --id {pr-id} --title "New title" --description "New description"
138: ```
139: 
140: ### Checkout PR Locally
141: 
142: ```bash
143: # Checkout PR branch
144: az repos pr checkout --id {pr-id}
145: 
146: # Checkout with specific remote
147: az repos pr checkout --id {pr-id} --remote-name upstream
148: ```
149: 
150: ### Vote on PR
151: 
152: ```bash
153: az repos pr set-vote --id {pr-id} --vote approve
154: az repos pr set-vote --id {pr-id} --vote approve-with-suggestions
155: az repos pr set-vote --id {pr-id} --vote reject
156: az repos pr set-vote --id {pr-id} --vote wait-for-author
157: az repos pr set-vote --id {pr-id} --vote reset
158: ```
159: 
160: ### PR Reviewers
161: 
162: ```bash
163: # Add reviewers
164: az repos pr reviewer add --id {pr-id} --reviewers user1@example.com user2@example.com
165: 
166: # List reviewers
167: az repos pr reviewer list --id {pr-id}
168: 
169: # Remove reviewers
170: az repos pr reviewer remove --id {pr-id} --reviewers user1@example.com
171: ```
172: 
173: ### PR Work Items
174: 
175: ```bash
176: # Add work items to PR
177: az repos pr work-item add --id {pr-id} --work-items {id1} {id2}
178: 
179: # List PR work items
180: az repos pr work-item list --id {pr-id}
181: 
182: # Remove work items from PR
183: az repos pr work-item remove --id {pr-id} --work-items {id1}
184: ```
185: 
186: ### PR Policies
187: 
188: ```bash
189: # List policies for a PR
190: az repos pr policy list --id {pr-id}
191: 
192: # Queue policy evaluation for a PR
193: az repos pr policy queue --id {pr-id} --evaluation-id {evaluation-id}
194: ```
195: 
196: ## Git References
197: 
198: ### List References (Branches)
199: 
200: ```bash
201: az repos ref list --repository {repo}
202: az repos ref list --repository {repo} --query "[?name=='refs/heads/main']"
203: ```
204: 
205: ### Create Reference (Branch)
206: 
207: ```bash
208: az repos ref create --name refs/heads/new-branch --object-type commit --object {commit-sha}
209: ```
210: 
211: ### Delete Reference (Branch)
212: 
213: ```bash
214: az repos ref delete --name refs/heads/old-branch --repository {repo} --project {project}
215: ```
216: 
217: ### Lock/Unlock Branch
218: 
219: ```bash
220: az repos ref lock --name refs/heads/main --repository {repo} --project {project}
221: az repos ref unlock --name refs/heads/main --repository {repo} --project {project}
222: ```
223: 
224: ## Repository Policies
225: 
226: ### List All Policies
227: 
228: ```bash
229: az repos policy list --repository {repo-id} --branch main
230: ```
231: 
232: ### Create/Update/Delete Policy
233: 
234: ```bash
235: # Create from config file
236: az repos policy create --config policy.json
237: 
238: # Update
239: az repos policy update --id {policy-id} --config updated-policy.json
240: 
241: # Delete
242: az repos policy delete --id {policy-id} --yes
243: ```
244: 
245: ### Approver Count Policy
246: 
247: ```bash
248: az repos policy approver-count create \
249:   --blocking true \
250:   --enabled true \
251:   --branch main \
252:   --repository-id {repo-id} \
253:   --minimum-approver-count 2 \
254:   --creator-vote-counts true
255: ```
256: 
257: ### Build Policy
258: 
259: ```bash
260: az repos policy build create \
261:   --blocking true \
262:   --enabled true \
263:   --branch main \
264:   --repository-id {repo-id} \
265:   --build-definition-id {definition-id} \
266:   --queue-on-source-update-only true \
267:   --valid-duration 720
268: ```
269: 
270: ### Work Item Linking Policy
271: 
272: ```bash
273: az repos policy work-item-linking create \
274:   --blocking true \
275:   --branch main \
276:   --enabled true \
277:   --repository-id {repo-id}
278: ```
279: 
280: ### Required Reviewer Policy
281: 
282: ```bash
283: az repos policy required-reviewer create \
284:   --blocking true \
285:   --enabled true \
286:   --branch main \
287:   --repository-id {repo-id} \
288:   --required-reviewers user@example.com
289: ```
290: 
291: ### Merge Strategy Policy
292: 
293: ```bash
294: az repos policy merge-strategy create \
295:   --blocking true \
296:   --enabled true \
297:   --branch main \
298:   --repository-id {repo-id} \
299:   --allow-squash true \
300:   --allow-rebase true \
301:   --allow-no-fast-forward true
302: ```
303: 
304: ### Case Enforcement Policy
305: 
306: ```bash
307: az repos policy case-enforcement create \
308:   --blocking true \
309:   --enabled true \
310:   --branch main \
311:   --repository-id {repo-id}
312: ```
313: 
314: ### Comment Required Policy
315: 
316: ```bash
317: az repos policy comment-required create \
318:   --blocking true \
319:   --enabled true \
320:   --branch main \
321:   --repository-id {repo-id}
322: ```
323: 
324: ### File Size Policy
325: 
326: ```bash
327: az repos policy file-size create \
328:   --blocking true \
329:   --enabled true \
330:   --branch main \
331:   --repository-id {repo-id} \
332:   --maximum-file-size 10485760  # 10MB in bytes
333: ```
</file>

