 20: 
 21: ### Create Variable
 22: 
 23: ```bash
 24: # Non-secret variable
 25: az pipelines variable create \
 26:   --name {var-name} \
 27:   --value {var-value} \
 28:   --pipeline-id {pipeline-id}
 29: 
