 71: ## Best Practices
 72: 
 73: ### Authentication and Security
 74: 
 75: ```bash
 76: # Use PAT from environment variable (most secure)
 77: export AZURE_DEVOPS_EXT_PAT=$MY_PAT
 78: az devops login --organization $ORG_URL
 79: 
 80: # Pipe PAT securely (avoids shell history)
 81: echo $MY_PAT | az devops login --organization $ORG_URL
 82: 
 83: # Set defaults to avoid repetition
 84: az devops configure --defaults organization=$ORG_URL project=$PROJECT
 85: 
 86: # Clear credentials after use
 87: az devops logout --organization $ORG_URL
 88: ```
