108: ### Script-Safe Output
109: 
110: ```bash
111: # Suppress warnings and errors
112: az pipelines list --only-show-errors
113: 
114: # No output (useful for commands that only need to execute)
115: az pipelines run --name "$PIPELINE_NAME" --output none
116: 
117: # TSV format for shell scripts (clean, no formatting)
118: az repos pr list --output tsv --query "[].{ID:pullRequestId,Title:title}"
119: 
120: # JSON with specific fields
121: az pipelines list --output json --query "[].{Name:name, ID:id, URL:url}"
122: ```
