12: ## Prerequisites
13: 
14: ```bash
15: # Install Azure CLI
16: brew install azure-cli  # macOS
17: curl -sL https://aka.ms/InstallAzureCLIDeb | sudo bash  # Linux
18: 
19: # Install Azure DevOps extension
20: az extension add --name azure-devops
21: ```
