<file path=".github/skills/mcpee-boost-mcpee-cloud/skills/azure-pricing/references/COPILOT-STUDIO-RATES.md">
  1: # Copilot Studio — Billing Rates & Estimation
  2: 
  3: > Source: [Billing rates and management](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/requirements-messages-management)
  4: > Estimator: [Microsoft agent usage estimator](https://microsoft.github.io/copilot-studio-estimator/)
  5: > Licensing Guide: [Copilot Studio Licensing Guide](https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2320995)
  6: 
  7: ## Copilot Credit Rate
  8: 
  9: **1 Copilot Credit = $0.01 USD**
 10: 
 11: ## Billing Rates (cached snapshot — last updated March 2026)
 12: 
 13: **IMPORTANT: Always prefer fetching live rates from the source URLs below. Use this table only as a fallback if web fetch is unavailable.**
 14: 
 15: | Feature | Rate | Unit |
 16: |---|---|---|
 17: | Classic answer | 1 | per response |
 18: | Generative answer | 2 | per response |
 19: | Agent action | 5 | per action (triggers, deep reasoning, topic transitions, computer use) |
 20: | Tenant graph grounding | 10 | per message |
 21: | Agent flow actions | 13 | per 100 flow actions |
 22: | Text & gen AI tools (basic) | 1 | per 10 responses |
 23: | Text & gen AI tools (standard) | 15 | per 10 responses |
 24: | Text & gen AI tools (premium) | 100 | per 10 responses |
 25: | Content processing tools | 8 | per page |
 26: 
 27: ### Notes
 28: 
 29: - **Classic answers**: Predefined, manually authored responses. Static — don't change unless updated by the maker.
 30: - **Generative answers**: Dynamically generated using AI models (GPTs). Adapt based on context and knowledge sources.
 31: - **Tenant graph grounding**: RAG over tenant-wide Microsoft Graph, including external data via connectors. Optional per agent.
 32: - **Agent actions**: Steps like triggers, deep reasoning, topic transitions visible in the activity map. Includes Computer-Using Agents.
 33: - **Text & gen AI tools**: Prompt tools embedded in agents. Three tiers (basic/standard/premium) based on the underlying language model.
 34: - **Agent flow actions**: Predefined flow action sequences executed without agent reasoning/orchestration at each step.
 35: 
 36: ### Reasoning Model Billing
 37: 
 38: When using a reasoning-capable model:
 39: 
 40: ```
 41: Total cost = feature rate for operation + text & gen AI tools (premium) per 10 responses
 42: ```
 43: 
 44: Example: A generative answer using a reasoning model costs **2 credits** (generative answer) **+ 10 credits** (premium per response, prorated from 100/10).
 45: 
 46: ## Estimation Formula
 47: 
 48: ### Inputs
 49: 
 50: | Parameter | Description |
 51: |---|---|
 52: | `users` | Number of end users |
 53: | `interactions_per_month` | Average interactions per user per month |
 54: | `knowledge_pct` | % of responses from knowledge sources (0-100) |
 55: | `tenant_graph_pct` | Of knowledge responses, % using tenant graph grounding (0-100) |
 56: | `tool_prompt` | Average Prompt tool calls per session |
 57: | `tool_agent_flow` | Average Agent flow calls per session |
 58: | `tool_computer_use` | Average Computer use calls per session |
 59: | `tool_custom_connector` | Average Custom connector calls per session |
 60: | `tool_mcp` | Average MCP (Model Context Protocol) calls per session |
 61: | `tool_rest_api` | Average REST API calls per session |
 62: | `prompts_basic` | Average basic AI prompt uses per session |
 63: | `prompts_standard` | Average standard AI prompt uses per session |
 64: | `prompts_premium` | Average premium AI prompt uses per session |
 65: 
 66: ### Calculation
 67: 
 68: ```
 69: total_sessions = users × interactions_per_month
 70: 
 71: ── Knowledge Credits ──
 72: tenant_graph_credits    = total_sessions × (knowledge_pct/100) × (tenant_graph_pct/100) × 10
 73: generative_answer_credits = total_sessions × (knowledge_pct/100) × (1 - tenant_graph_pct/100) × 2
 74: classic_answer_credits  = total_sessions × (1 - knowledge_pct/100) × 1
 75: 
 76: ── Agent Tools Credits ──
 77: tool_calls = total_sessions × (prompt + computer_use + custom_connector + mcp + rest_api)
 78: tool_credits = tool_calls × 5
 79: 
 80: ── Agent Flow Credits ──
 81: flow_calls = total_sessions × tool_agent_flow
 82: flow_credits = ceil(flow_calls / 100) × 13
 83: 
 84: ── Prompt Modifier Credits ──
 85: basic_credits    = ceil(total_sessions × prompts_basic / 10) × 1
 86: standard_credits = ceil(total_sessions × prompts_standard / 10) × 15
 87: premium_credits  = ceil(total_sessions × prompts_premium / 10) × 100
 88: 
 89: ── Total ──
 90: total_credits = knowledge + tools + flows + prompts
 91: cost_usd = total_credits × 0.01
 92: ```
 93: 
 94: ## Billing Examples (from Microsoft Docs)
 95: 
 96: ### Customer Support Agent
 97: 
 98: - 4 classic answers + 2 generative answers per session
 99: - 900 customers/day
100: - **Daily**: `[(4×1) + (2×2)] × 900 = 7,200 credits`
101: - **Monthly (30d)**: ~216,000 credits = **~$2,160**
102: 
103: ### Sales Performance Agent (Tenant Graph Grounded)
104: 
105: - 4 generative answers + 4 tenant graph grounded responses per session
106: - 100 unlicensed users
107: - **Daily**: `[(4×2) + (4×10)] × 100 = 4,800 credits`
108: - **Monthly (30d)**: ~144,000 credits = **~$1,440**
109: 
110: ### Order Processing Agent
111: 
112: - 4 action calls per trigger (autonomous)
113: - **Per trigger**: `4 × 5 = 20 credits`
114: 
115: ## Employee vs Customer Agent Types
116: 
117: | Agent Type | Included with M365 Copilot? |
118: |---|---|
119: | Employee-facing (BtoE) | Classic answers, generative answers, and tenant graph grounding are included at zero cost when the user has a Microsoft 365 Copilot license |
120: | Customer/partner-facing | All usage is billed normally |
121: 
122: ## Overage Enforcement
123: 
124: - Triggered at **125%** of prepaid capacity
125: - Custom agents are disabled (ongoing conversations continue)
126: - Email notification sent to tenant admin
127: - Resolution: reallocate capacity, purchase more, or enable pay-as-you-go
128: 
