130: 
131: For the latest rates, fetch content from these pages:
132: 
133: - [Billing rates and management](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/requirements-messages-management)
134: - [Copilot Studio licensing](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-copilot-studio/billing-licensing)
