395: 1. Replace `YourSolution.sln`, `YourProject.csproj`, etc. with your actual file names
396: 2. Adjust the Windows Server and .NET Framework versions as needed
397: 3. Modify the dependency installation steps based on your requirements and remove any unnecessary ones
398: 4. Add or remove stages as needed for your specific workflow
399: 
400: ## Notes on Stage Naming
401: 
402: - The `AS stage-name` syntax gives each stage a name
