 39: 
 40: ## Execution Flow Diagram
 41: 
 42: ```mermaid
 43: graph TD
 44:     A[Trigger Event] --> B[Job 1]
 45:     B --> C[Job 2]
 46:     C --> D[Job 3]
 47:     D --> E[End]
 48:     
 49:     B --> F[Parallel Job]
 50:     F --> D
