  1: # draw.io Shape Libraries
  2: 
  3: Reference guide for all built-in shape libraries. Enable via `View > Shapes` in the draw.io editor (or VS Code extension shape panel).
  4: 
  5: ---
  6: 
  7: ## Library Catalog
  8: 
  9: ### General
 10: 
 11: **Enable**: Always active by default
 12: 
 13: Common shapes for any diagram type.
 14: 
 15: | Shape | Style Key | Use For |
 16: | ------- | ----------- | --------- |
 17: | Rectangle | *(default)* | Boxes, steps, components |
 18: | Rounded Rectangle | `rounded=1;` | Softer process boxes |
 19: | Ellipse | `ellipse;` | States, start/end |
 20: | Triangle | `triangle;` | Arrows, gates |
 21: | Diamond | `rhombus;` | Decisions |
 22: | Hexagon | `shape=hexagon;` | Labels, tech icons |
 23: | Cloud | `shape=cloud;` | Cloud services |
 24: | Cylinder | `shape=cylinder3;` | Databases |
 25: | Note | `shape=note;` | Annotations |
 26: | Document | `shape=document;` | Files |
 27: | Arrow shapes | Various `mxgraph.arrows2.*` | Flow directions |
 28: | Callouts | `shape=callout;` | Speech bubbles |
 29: 
 30: ---
 31: 
 32: ### Flowchart
 33: 
 34: **Enable**: `View > Shapes > Flowchart`  
 35: **Shape prefix**: `mxgraph.flowchart.`
 36: 
 37: Standard ANSI/ISO flowchart symbols.
 38: 
 39: | Symbol | Style String | ANSI Name |
 40: | -------- | ------------- | ----------- |
 41: | Start / End | `ellipse;` | Terminal |
 42: | Process (rectangle) | `rounded=1;` | Process |
 43: | Decision | `rhombus;` | Decision |
 44: | I/O (parallelogram) | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.io;` | Data |
 45: | Predefined Process | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.predefined_process;` | Predefined Process |
 46: | Manual Operation | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.manual_operation;` | Manual Operation |
 47: | Manual Input | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.manual_input;` | Manual Input |
 48: | Database | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.database;` | Direct Access Storage |
 49: | Document | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.document;` | Document |
 50: | Multiple Documents | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.multi-document;` | Multiple Documents |
 51: | On-page Connector | `ellipse;` (small, 30×30) | Connector |
 52: | Off-page Connector | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.off_page_connector;` | Off-page Connector |
 53: | Preparation | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.preparation;` | Preparation |
 54: | Delay | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.delay;` | Delay |
 55: | Display | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.display;` | Display |
 56: | Internal Storage | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.internal_storage;` | Internal Storage |
 57: | Sort | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.sort;` | Sort |
 58: | Extract | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.extract;` | Extract |
 59: | Merge | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.merge;` | Merge |
 60: | Or | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.or;` | Or |
 61: | Annotation | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.annotation;` | Annotation |
 62: | Card | `shape=mxgraph.flowchart.card;` | Punched Card |
 63: 
 64: **Complete flowchart example style strings:**
 65: 
 66: ```text
 67: Process:          rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;
 68: Decision:         rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;
 69: Start/End:        ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;
 70: Database:         shape=mxgraph.flowchart.database;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;
 71: Document:         shape=mxgraph.flowchart.document;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;
 72: I/O (Data):       shape=mxgraph.flowchart.io;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;
 73: ```
 74: 
 75: ---
 76: 
 77: ### UML
 78: 
 79: **Enable**: `View > Shapes > UML`
 80: 
 81: #### Use Case Diagrams
 82: 
 83: | Shape | Style String |
 84: | ------- | ------------- |
 85: | Actor | `shape=mxgraph.uml.actor;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;` |
 86: | Use Case (ellipse) | `ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;` |
 87: | System Boundary | `swimlane;startSize=30;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;` |
 88: 
 89: #### Class Diagrams
 90: 
 91: Use swimlane containers for class boxes:
 92: 
 93: ```xml
 94: <!-- Class container -->
 95: <mxCell value="«interface»&#xa;IOrderService" 
 96:         style="swimlane;fontStyle=1;align=center;startSize=30;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;"
 97:         vertex="1" parent="1">
 98:   <mxGeometry x="200" y="100" width="200" height="160" as="geometry" />
 99: </mxCell>
100: 
101: <!-- Attributes (child of class) -->
102: <mxCell value="+ id: string&#xa;+ status: string" 
103:         style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;overflow=hidden;html=1;"
104:         vertex="1" parent="classId">
105:   <mxGeometry y="30" width="200" height="60" as="geometry" />
106: </mxCell>
107: 
108: <!-- Method separator line -->
109: <mxCell value="" style="line;strokeWidth=1;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="classId">
110:   <mxGeometry y="90" width="200" height="10" as="geometry" />
111: </mxCell>
112: 
113: <!-- Methods (child of class) -->
114: <mxCell value="+ create(): Order&#xa;+ cancel(): void"
115:         style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;overflow=hidden;html=1;"
116:         vertex="1" parent="classId">
117:   <mxGeometry y="100" width="200" height="60" as="geometry" />
118: </mxCell>
119: ```
120: 
121: #### UML Relationship Arrows
122: 
123: | Relationship | Style String |
124: | ------------- | ------------- |
125: | Inheritance (extends) | `edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=0;` |
126: | Implementation (implements) | `edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;dashed=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=0;` |
127: | Association | `edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;` |
128: | Dependency | `edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;dashed=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;` |
129: | Aggregation | `edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;startArrow=diamond;startFill=0;endArrow=none;` |
130: | Composition | `edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;startArrow=diamond;startFill=1;endArrow=none;` |
131: 
132: #### Component Diagram
133: 
134: | Shape | Style String |
135: | ------- | ------------- |
136: | Component | `shape=component;align=left;spacingLeft=36;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;` |
137: | Interface (lollipop) | `ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;` (small circle) |
138: | Port | `shape=mxgraph.uml.port;` |
139: | Node | `shape=mxgraph.uml.node;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;` |
140: | Artifact | `shape=mxgraph.uml.artifact;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;` |
141: 
142: #### Sequence Diagrams
143: 
144: | Shape | Style String |
145: | ------- | ------------- |
146: | Actor | `shape=mxgraph.uml.actor;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;` |
147: | Lifeline (object) | `shape=umlLifeline;startSize=40;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;` |
148: | Activation box | `shape=umlActivation;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;` |
149: | Sync message | `edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;elbow=vertical;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;` |
150: | Async message | `edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;elbow=vertical;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;` |
151: | Return | `edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;elbow=vertical;dashed=1;html=1;endArrow=open;endFill=0;` |
152: | Self-call | `edgeStyle=elbowEdgeStyle;elbow=vertical;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;html=1;` |
153: 
154: #### State Diagrams
155: 
156: | Shape | Style String |
157: | ------- | ------------- |
158: | Initial state (solid circle) | `ellipse;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;` |
159: | State | `rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=50;` |
160: | Final state | `shape=doubleEllipse;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;` |
161: | Transition | `edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;` |
162: | Fork/Join | `shape=mxgraph.uml.fork_or_join;html=1;fillColor=#000000;` |
163: 
164: ---
165: 
166: ### Entity Relationship (ER Diagrams)
167: 
168: **Enable**: `View > Shapes > Entity Relation`
169: 
170: #### Modern ER Tables (crow's foot notation)
171: 
172: ```xml
173: <!-- Table container -->
174: <mxCell id="tbl-orders" value="orders"
175:         style="shape=table;startSize=30;container=1;collapsible=1;childLayout=tableLayout;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=1;"
176:         vertex="1" parent="1">
177:   <mxGeometry x="80" y="80" width="240" height="210" as="geometry" />
178: </mxCell>
179: 
180: <!-- Column row -->
181: <mxCell id="col-id" value=""
182:         style="shape=tableRow;horizontal=0;startSize=0;swimmilaneHead=0;swimlaneBody=0;fillColor=none;collapsible=0;dropTarget=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;"
183:         vertex="1" parent="tbl-orders">
184:   <mxGeometry y="30" width="240" height="30" as="geometry" />
185: </mxCell>
186: 
187: <!-- PK marker cell -->
188: <mxCell value="PK" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;fontStyle=1;overflow=hidden;"
189:         vertex="1" parent="col-id">
190:   <mxGeometry width="40" height="30" as="geometry" />
191: </mxCell>
192: 
193: <!-- Column name cell -->
194: <mxCell value="id" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;"
195:         vertex="1" parent="col-id">
196:   <mxGeometry x="40" width="140" height="30" as="geometry" />
197: </mxCell>
198: 
199: <!-- Data type cell -->
200: <mxCell value="UUID" style="shape=partialRectangle;connectable=0;fillColor=none;top=0;left=0;bottom=0;right=0;overflow=hidden;fontStyle=2;"
201:         vertex="1" parent="col-id">
202:   <mxGeometry x="180" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
203: </mxCell>
204: ```
205: 
206: #### ER Relationship Connectors (crow's foot)
207: 
208: | Cardinality | Style String |
209: | ------------- | ------------- |
210: | One-to-one | `edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERmandOne;startFill=1;endFill=1;` |
211: | One-to-many | `edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERmany;startFill=1;endFill=1;` |
212: | Zero-to-many | `edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToMany;startFill=1;endFill=0;` |
213: | Zero-to-one | `edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;startArrow=ERmandOne;endArrow=ERzeroToOne;startFill=1;endFill=0;` |
214: | Many-to-many | `edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;html=1;startArrow=ERmany;endArrow=ERmany;startFill=1;endFill=1;` |
215: 
216: ---
217: 
218: ### Network / Infrastructure
219: 
220: **Enable**: `View > Shapes > Networking`
221: 
222: | Shape | Style String |
223: | ------- | ------------- |
224: | Generic server | `shape=server;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;` |
225: | Web server | `shape=mxgraph.network.web_server;` |
226: | Database server | `shape=mxgraph.network.database;` |
