  1: # draw.io Style Reference
  2: 
  3: Complete reference for the `style` attribute on `<mxCell>` elements. Styles are semicolon-delimited `key=value` pairs.
  4: 
  5: ---
  6: 
  7: ## Style Format
  8: 
  9: ```text
 10: style="key1=value1;key2=value2;key3=value3;"
 11: ```
 12: 
 13: - Keys and values are case-sensitive
 14: - Trailing semicolon is optional but recommended
 15: - Unknown keys are silently ignored
 16: - Missing keys use draw.io defaults
 17: 
 18: ---
 19: 
 20: ## Universal Style Keys
 21: 
 22: Apply to all shapes and edges.
 23: 
 24: | Key | Values | Default | Description |
 25: | ----- | -------- | --------- | ------------- |
 26: | `fillColor` | `#hex` / `none` | `#FFFFFF` | Shape fill color (draw.io default; use semantic palette for project diagrams) |
 27: | `strokeColor` | `#hex` / `none` | `#000000` | Border/line color (draw.io default; use semantic palette for project diagrams) |
 28: | `fontColor` | `#hex` | `#000000` | Text color |
 29: | `fontSize` | integer | `11` | Font size in pt |
 30: | `fontStyle` | bitmask (see below) | `0` | Bold/italic/underline |
 31: | `fontFamily` | string | `Helvetica` | Font family name |
 32: | `align` | `left`/`center`/`right` | `center` | Horizontal text alignment |
 33: | `verticalAlign` | `top`/`middle`/`bottom` | `middle` | Vertical text alignment |
 34: | `opacity` | 0–100 | `100` | Shape opacity (%) |
 35: | `shadow` | `0`/`1` | `0` | Drop shadow |
 36: | `dashed` | `0`/`1` | `0` | Dashed border |
 37: | `dashPattern` | e.g. `8 8` | — | Custom dash/gap pattern (px) |
 38: | `strokeWidth` | float | `2` | Border/line width in px |
 39: | `spacing` | integer | `2` | Padding around text (px) |
 40: | `spacingTop` | integer | `0` | Top text padding |
 41: | `spacingBottom` | integer | `0` | Bottom text padding |
 42: | `spacingLeft` | integer | `4` | Left text padding |
 43: | `spacingRight` | integer | `4` | Right text padding |
 44: | `html` | `0`/`1` | `0` | Allow HTML in label |
 45: | `whiteSpace` | `wrap`/`nowrap` | `nowrap` | Text wrapping |
 46: | `overflow` | `visible`/`hidden`/`fill` | `visible` | Text overflow behaviour |
 47: | `rotatable` | `0`/`1` | `1` | Allow rotation in editor |
 48: | `movable` | `0`/`1` | `1` | Allow move in editor |
 49: | `resizable` | `0`/`1` | `1` | Allow resize in editor |
 50: | `deletable` | `0`/`1` | `1` | Allow delete in editor |
 51: | `editable` | `0`/`1` | `1` | Allow label edit in editor |
 52: | `locked` | `0`/`1` | `0` | Lock all editing |
 53: | `nolabel` | `0`/`1` | `0` | Hide label entirely |
 54: | `noLabel` | `0`/`1` | `0` | Alias of `nolabel` |
 55: | `labelPosition` | `left`/`center`/`right` | `center` | Label anchor horizontal |
 56: | `verticalLabelPosition` | `top`/`middle`/`bottom` | `middle` | Label anchor vertical |
 57: | `imageAlign` | `left`/`center`/`right` | `center` | Image alignment |
 58: 
 59: ### `fontStyle` Bitmask Values
 60: 
 61: | Value | Effect |
 62: | ------- | -------- |
 63: | `0` | Normal |
 64: | `1` | Bold |
 65: | `2` | Italic |
 66: | `4` | Underline |
 67: | `8` | Strikethrough |
 68: 
 69: Combine by addition: `3` = bold + italic, `5` = bold + underline, `7` = bold + italic + underline.
