325: ### 10. Inappropriate Intimacy
326: 
327: ```diff
328: # BAD: One class reaches deep into another
329: - class OrderProcessor {
330: -   process(order) {
331: -     order.user.profile.address.street;  // Too intimate
332: -     order.repository.connection.config;  // Breaking encapsulation
333: +   }
334: + }
335: 
336: # GOOD: Ask, don't tell
337: + class OrderProcessor {
338: +   process(order) {
339: +     order.getShippingAddress();  // Order knows how to get it
340: +     order.save();  // Order knows how to save itself
341: +   }
342: + }
