  1: ---
  2: name: 'component-inventory'
  3: description: 'Cataloga y gestiona componentes UI en tu codebase. Crea inventarios, detecta duplicados, identifica oportunidades de reutilizabilidad y genera informes de uso de componentes con documentación visual.'
  4: ---
  5: 
  6: # Skill de Inventario de Componentes
  7: 
  8: Este skill te ayuda a entender y optimizar el panorama de tus componentes.
  9: 
 10: ## Capacidades
 11: 
 12: ### 1. Detección y Catalogación de Componentes
 13: - Descubre automáticamente todos los componentes UI
 14: - Extrae metadatos del componente (props, exports, dependencias)
 15: - Genera inventario de componentes
 16: - Rastrea ubicaciones y relaciones de componentes
 17: 
 18: ### 2. Análisis e Insights
 19: - Detecta componentes duplicados o similares
 20: - Identifica oportunidades de reutilizabilidad
 21: - Analiza dependencias de componentes
 22: - Genera estadísticas de uso de componentes
 23: - Encuentra componentes huérfanos o sin uso
 24: 
 25: ### 3. Identificación de Librerías
 26: - Detecta las librerías de componentes en uso (Material-UI, Chakra, Shadcn, etc.)
 27: - Analiza componentes custom vs. componentes de librería
 28: - Identifica librerías mixtas o en conflicto
 29: - Genera informe de uso de librerías
 30: 
 31: ### 4. Generación de Documentación
 32: - Crea inventario de componentes con descripciones
 33: - Genera ejemplos de uso de componentes
 34: - Crea documentación de API de componentes
 35: - Genera gráficos de dependencias de componentes
 36: - Crea catálogo visual de componentes
 37: 
 38: ### 5. Recomendaciones de Reutilizabilidad
 39: - Identifica componentes que deberían extraerse
 40: - Sugiere composiciones de componentes
 41: - Recomienda abstracciones
 42: - Guía esfuerzos de refactoring
 43: 
 44: ## Artefactos de Salida
 45: 
 46: ### Archivos de Inventario
 47: - `component-inventory.json` - Complete component catalog
 48: - `component-map.md` - Human-readable component map
 49: - `components.html` - Visual component gallery
 50: 
 51: ### Informes de Análisis
 52: - `duplicates.json` - Duplicate component analysis
 53: - `unused-components.md` - Potentially unused components
 54: - `reusability-opportunities.md` - Refactoring recommendations
 55: - `library-report.md` - Library usage analysis
 56: - `dependency-graph.html` - Component dependency visualization
 57: 
 58: ### Documentación
 59: - `COMPONENT_GUIDE.md` - Component usage guide
 60: - `REFACTORING_PLAN.md` - Component improvements roadmap
 61: 
 62: ## Formato del Inventario de Componentes
 63: 
 64: ```json
 65: {
 66:   "components": [
 67:     {
 68:       "name": "Button",
 69:       "path": "src/components/Button/Button.tsx",
 70:       "type": "functional",
 71:       "props": [
 72:         {"name": "variant", "type": "string", "required": false},
 73:         {"name": "size", "type": "string", "required": false},
 74:         {"name": "onClick", "type": "function", "required": false}
 75:       ],
 76:       "description": "Primary button component",
 77:       "usageCount": 42,
 78:       "lastModified": "2024-01-15",
 79:       "library": "custom",
 80:       "exports": ["Button", "ButtonGroup"]
 81:     }
 82:   ],
 83:   "libraries": ["@mui/material", "custom"],
 84:   "stats": {
 85:     "total": 125,
 86:     "custom": 95,
 87:     "library": 30,
 88:     "duplicates": 3
 89:   }
 90: }
 91: ```
 92: 
 93: ## Uso
 94: 
 95: ```bash
 96: # Generate component inventory
 97: npm run component:inventory
 98: 
 99: # Analyze for duplicates
100: npm run component:analyze-duplicates
101: 
102: # Find unused components
103: npm run component:find-unused
104: 
105: # Generate visual catalog
106: npm run component:generate-catalog
107: 
108: # Create refactoring plan
109: npm run component:refactoring-plan
110: ```
111: 
112: ## Tipos de Archivo Soportados
113: 
114: - **React**: `.tsx`, `.jsx`, `.ts`, `.js`
115: - **Angular**: `.component.ts`, `.component.html`
116: - **Vue**: `.vue`
117: - **Web Components**: `.ts`, `.js`
118: 
119: ## Reglas de Detección
120: 
121: Scans for:
122: - React functional and class components
123: - Angular component decorators
124: - Vue single-file components
125: - Web components (custom elements)
126: - Component exports and default exports
127: 
128: ## Analysis Features
129: 
130: ### Duplication Detection
131: - Identifies components with similar props and structure
132: - Suggests consolidation opportunities
133: - Provides side-by-side comparison
134: 
135: ### Unused Detection
136: - Tracks component imports
137: - Identifies components with zero usage
138: - Filters out utility/utility-component patterns
139: - Generates safe-to-remove list
140: 
141: ### Reusability Scoring
142: - Scores components by reusability potential
143: - Prioritizes high-impact refactoring
144: - Suggests component hierarchies
145: - Identifies composition patterns
146: 
147: ## Integration Points
148: 
149: - **Figma**: Map components to design system
150: - **Documentation**: Auto-generate component guides
151: - **CI/CD**: Track component metrics over time
152: - **Testing**: Generate component test templates
153: - **Linting**: Enforce component standards
154: 
155: ## Output Examples
156: 
157: ### Component Card
158: ```markdown
159: ## Button
160: 
161: **Path**: `src/components/Button/Button.tsx`
162: **Usage**: 42 instances across 15 files
163: **Type**: Custom component
164: **Props**: `variant`, `size`, `onClick`, `disabled`, `children`
165: 
166: Versatile button component used for all interactive button needs.
167: Supports multiple sizes and variants.
168: 
169: ### Example
170: ```tsx
171: <Button variant="primary" size="lg" onClick={handleClick}>
172:   Click me
173: </Button>
174: ```
175: ```
176: 
177: ## Best Practices
178: 
179: 1. **Regular Updates**: Re-run inventory monthly
180: 2. **Track Metrics**: Monitor component growth
181: 3. **Document Standards**: Define component patterns
182: 4. **Refactor Incrementally**: Address high-impact duplicates first
183: 5. **Version Components**: Track component changes
184: 6. **Test Coverage**: Ensure all components have tests
185: 
186: ## Related Skills
187: 
188: - `design-system-generator` - Create systems from components
189: - `figma-integration` - Map to design system
190: - `ux-audit` - Audit component consistency
191: - `screenshot-reporter` - Generate visual documentation
192: 
193: ## Next Steps
194: 
195: 1. **Review Inventory**: Understand current component landscape
196: 2. **Identify Opportunities**: Find quick wins for consolidation
197: 3. **Plan Refactoring**: Create prioritized improvement plan
198: 4. **Execute**: Implement changes incrementally
199: 5. **Document**: Update component guide with findings
</file>

<file path=".github/skills/mcpee-boost-mcpee-uxdesign/skills/css-scss-best-practices/SKILL.md">
  1: ---
  2: name: css-scss-best-practices
  3: description: 'Domina la organización CSS y SCSS, patrones de arquitectura (BEM, SMACSS), design tokens, mixins, funciones y diseño responsivo. Incluye mejores prácticas de MDN y documentación Sass con patrones listos para producción.'
  4: ---
  5: 
  6: # Mejores Prácticas CSS y SCSS
  7: 
  8: Construye hojas de estilo mantenibles y escalables con patrones estándar de la industria. Este skill cubre fundamentos CSS, características avanzadas de SCSS y enfoques arquitectónicos siguiendo https://sass-lang.com/documentation y https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS.
  9: 
 10: ## Fundamentos CSS
 11: 
 12: ### 1. **Cascada CSS y Especificidad**
 13: 
 14: **Entendiendo la Cascada:**
 15: ```css
 16: /* Good: Lower specificity first, then build up */
 17: button {
 18:   padding: 8px 16px;
 19:   border-radius: 4px;
 20: }
 21: 
 22: button:hover {
 23:   background-color: var(--color-primary-hover);
 24: }
 25: 
 26: button.btn--large {
 27:   padding: 12px 24px;
 28:   font-size: 18px;
 29: }
 30: 
 31: button:disabled {
 32:   opacity: 0.5;
 33: }
 34: ```
 35: 
 36: **Jerarquía de Especificidad:**
 37: ```
 38: Inline styles        1000
 39: IDs (#id)            100
 40: Classes (.class)     10
 41: Elements (div)       1
 42: ```
 43: 
 44: **Mejores Prácticas:**
 45: ```css
 46: /* ✅ Good: Use classes for styling, low specificity */
 47: .button { }
 48: .button:hover { }
 49: .button--primary { }
 50: 
 51: /* ❌ Bad: High specificity, harder to override */
 52: div#main .container button.btn { }
 53: button#submit { }
 54: ```
 55: 
 56: ### 2. **Variables CSS (Custom Properties)**
 57: 
 58: **Definición y Uso:**
 59: ```css
 60: :root {
 61:   /* Colors */
 62:   --color-primary: #0066cc;
 63:   --color-on-primary: #ffffff;
 64: 
 65:   /* Spacing (8px grid) */
 66:   --spacing-xs: 4px;
 67:   --spacing-sm: 8px;
 68:   --spacing-md: 16px;
 69:   --spacing-lg: 24px;
 70:   --spacing-xl: 32px;
 71: 
 72:   /* Typography */
 73:   --font-size-sm: 14px;
 74:   --font-size-base: 16px;
 75:   --font-size-lg: 18px;
 76: 
 77:   --line-height-tight: 1.2;
 78:   --line-height-normal: 1.5;
 79: 
 80:   /* Shadows */
 81:   --shadow-sm: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
 82:   --shadow-md: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
 83:   --shadow-lg: 0 10px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
 84: 
 85:   /* Border Radius */
 86:   --radius-sm: 4px;
 87:   --radius-md: 8px;
 88:   --radius-lg: 12px;
 89: }
 90: 
 91: /* Dark mode theme */
 92: [data-theme="dark"] {
 93:   --color-primary: #3399ff;
 94:   --color-on-primary: #000000;
 95: }
 96: 
 97: /* Component usage */
 98: .button {
 99:   padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);
100:   border-radius: var(--radius-md);
101:   font-size: var(--font-size-base);
102:   line-height: var(--line-height-normal);
103:   box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
104: }
105: ```
106: 
107: **Valores de Fallback:**
108: ```css
109: .button {
110:   /* Fallback if variable not supported (old browsers) */
111:   padding: 8px 16px;
112:   padding: var(--spacing-md, 16px);
113: }
114: ```
115: 
116: ### 3. **Patrones de Diseño Responsivo**
117: 
118: **Enfoque Mobile-First (Recomendado):**
119: ```css
120: /* Mobile (small screens) - default */
121: .container {
122:   padding: var(--spacing-md);
123:   font-size: var(--font-size-base);
124:   grid-template-columns: 1fr;
125: }
126: 
127: /* Tablet */
128: @media (min-width: 640px) {
129:   .container {
130:     grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
131:   }
132: }
133: 
134: /* Desktop */
135: @media (min-width: 1024px) {
136:   .container {
137:     grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
138:     padding: var(--spacing-lg);
139:   }
140: }
141: ```
142: 
143: **Breakpoints (Estándar):**
144: ```css
145: /* Common breakpoints */
146: @media (min-width: 320px)  { } /* xs: Mobile */
147: @media (min-width: 640px)  { } /* sm: Small tablet */
148: @media (min-width: 1024px) { } /* md: Large tablet */
149: @media (min-width: 1280px) { } /* lg: Desktop */
150: @media (min-width: 1536px) { } /* xl: Large desktop */
151: ```
152: 
153: **Consultas de Orientación y Características:**
154: ```css
155: /* Dark mode preference */
156: @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
157:   :root {
158:     --color-bg: #1a1a1a;
159:     --color-text: #ffffff;
160:   }
161: }
162: 
163: /* Reduced motion preference */
164: @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
165:   * {
166:     animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
167:     animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
168:     transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
169:   }
170: }
171: 
172: /* Touch devices */
173: @media (hover: none) and (pointer: coarse) {
174:   button {
175:     min-height: 48px; /* Touch target */
176:   }
177: }
178: ```
179: 
180: ## Características SCSS
181: 
182: ### 1. **Variables y Anidamiento**
183: 
184: ```scss
185: // Variables
186: $primary-color: #0066cc;
187: $spacing-unit: 8px;
188: $base-font-size: 16px;
189: 
190: // Nesting
191: .button {
192:   padding: $spacing-unit * 2 $spacing-unit * 3;
193:   border-radius: 4px;
194: 
195:   &:hover {
196:     background-color: darken($primary-color, 10%);
197:   }
198: 
199:   &:disabled {
200:     opacity: 0.5;
201:   }
202: 
203:   &--primary {
204:     background-color: $primary-color;
205:     color: white;
206:   }
207: 
208:   &--secondary {
209:     background-color: lighten($primary-color, 20%);
210:   }
211: }
212: ```
213: 
214: ### 2. **Mixins (Bloques Reutilizables)**
215: 
216: ```scss
217: // Mixin with parameters
218: @mixin flex-center($direction: row) {
219:   display: flex;
220:   align-items: center;
221:   justify-content: center;
222:   flex-direction: $direction;
223: }
224: 
225: @mixin button-variant($bg-color, $text-color) {
226:   background-color: $bg-color;
227:   color: $text-color;
228: 
229:   &:hover:not(:disabled) {
230:     background-color: darken($bg-color, 10%);
231:   }
232: }
233: 
234: @mixin responsive-font($mobile, $desktop) {
235:   font-size: $mobile;
236: 
237:   @media (min-width: 1024px) {
238:     font-size: $desktop;
239:   }
240: }
241: 
242: @mixin focus-visible {
243:   &:focus-visible {
244:     outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus);
245:     outline-offset: 2px;
246:   }
247: }
248: 
249: // Usage
250: .button {
251:   @include flex-center(row);
252:   @include button-variant(#0066cc, white);
253:   @include focus-visible;
254:   @include responsive-font(14px, 16px);
255: }
256: ```
257: 
258: ### 3. **Funciones**
259: 
260: ```scss
261: // Color functions
262: @function get-contrast-color($bg-color) {
263:   @if (lightness($bg-color) > 50%) {
264:     @return #000000;
265:   } @else {
266:     @return #ffffff;
267:   }
268: }
269: 
270: // Spacing function
271: @function spacing($multiplier: 1) {
272:   @return 8px * $multiplier;
273: }
274: 
275: // Usage
276: .button {
277:   padding: spacing(1) spacing(2);
278:   background-color: #0066cc;
279:   color: get-contrast-color(#0066cc); // #ffffff
280: }
281: ```
282: 
283: ### 4. **Extends (Herencia)**
284: 
285: ```scss
286: // Base placeholder
287: %button-base {
288:   display: inline-flex;
289:   align-items: center;
290:   justify-content: center;
291:   min-height: 44px;
292:   padding: 8px 16px;
293:   border-radius: 4px;
294:   border: none;
295:   cursor: pointer;
296:   transition: all 200ms ease;
297:   font-weight: 500;
298: }
299: 
300: %form-element {
301:   font-size: 16px;
302:   font-family: inherit;
303:   border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
304: }
305: 
306: // Usage
307: .button {
308:   @extend %button-base;
309:   @extend %form-element;
310:   background-color: var(--color-primary);
311: }
312: 
313: .link-button {
314:   @extend %button-base;
315:   background-color: transparent;
316:   text-decoration: underline;
317: }
318: ```
319: 
320: ## Architecture Patterns
321: 
322: ### 1. **BEM (Block Element Modifier)**
323: 
324: **Naming Convention:**
325: ```scss
326: .block { }
327: .block__element { }
328: .block--modifier { }
329: .block__element--modifier { }
330: 
331: // Example
332: .button { }
333: .button__icon { }
334: .button__text { }
335: .button--primary { }
336: .button--large { }
337: .button__icon--large { }
338: ```
339: 
340: **Implementation:**
341: ```scss
342: .card {
343:   padding: var(--spacing-md);
344:   border-radius: var(--radius-md);
345:   box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
346: 
347:   &__header {
348:     margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
349:     border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
350:   }
351: 
352:   &__title {
353:     font-size: 20px;
354:     font-weight: 600;
355:   }
356: 
357:   &__content {
358:     margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;
359:   }
360: 
361:   &--highlighted {
362:     border: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
363:   }
364: 
365:   &--compact {
366:     padding: var(--spacing-sm);
367:   }
368: }
369: 
370: // HTML
371: <div class="card card--highlighted">
372:   <div class="card__header">
373:     <h2 class="card__title">Title</h2>
374:   </div>
375:   <div class="card__content">Content</div>
376: </div>
377: ```
378: 
379: ### 2. **SMACSS (Scalable and Modular Architecture)**
380: 
381: **Structure:**
382: ```
383: styles/
384: ├── base/           # HTML elements, resets
385: ├── layout/         # Major layout components
386: ├── modules/        # Reusable components
387: ├── state/          # State classes (.is-active, .is-hidden)
388: ├── theme/          # Theme variables
389: └── utilities/      # Utility classes (.u-hide, .u-center)
390: ```
391: 
392: **File Organization:**
393: ```scss
394: // styles/base/_reset.scss
395: * {
396:   box-sizing: border-box;
397: }
398: 
399: body {
400:   margin: 0;
401:   font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto;
402: }
403: 
404: // styles/theme/_variables.scss
405: :root {
406:   --color-primary: #0066cc;
407:   --spacing-md: 16px;
408: }
409: 
410: // styles/modules/_button.scss
411: .button {
412:   display: inline-flex;
413:   padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-md);
414: }
415: 
416: // styles/state/_states.scss
417: .is-active {
418:   border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-primary);
419: }
420: 
421: .is-hidden {
422:   display: none;
423: }
424: 
425: .is-disabled {
426:   opacity: 0.5;
427:   cursor: not-allowed;
428: }
429: 
430: // styles/utilities/_utilities.scss
431: .u-center {
432:   text-align: center;
433: }
434: 
435: .u-flex-center {
436:   display: flex;
437:   align-items: center;
438:   justify-content: center;
439: }
440: ```
441: 
442: ### 3. **Design Tokens System**
443: 
444: ```scss
445: // styles/tokens/_colors.scss
446: $colors: (
447:   'primary': #0066cc,
448:   'secondary': #f0f0f0,
449:   'success': #28a745,
450:   'danger': #dc3545,
451:   'warning': #ffc107,
452: );
453: 
454: @function color($name) {
455:   @return map-get($colors, $name);
456: }
457: 
458: // styles/tokens/_spacing.scss
459: $spacing-unit: 8px;
460: 
461: $spacing: (
462:   'xs': $spacing-unit * 0.5,
463:   'sm': $spacing-unit,
464:   'md': $spacing-unit * 2,
465:   'lg': $spacing-unit * 3,
466:   'xl': $spacing-unit * 4,
467: );
468: 
469: @function spacing($size) {
470:   @return map-get($spacing, $size);
471: }
472: 
473: // styles/tokens/_typography.scss
474: $typography: (
475:   'xs': (
476:     'size': 12px,
477:     'weight': 400,
478:     'line-height': 1.4,
479:   ),
480:   'sm': (
481:     'size': 14px,
482:     'weight': 400,
483:     'line-height': 1.5,
484:   ),
485:   'base': (
486:     'size': 16px,
487:     'weight': 400,
488:     'line-height': 1.5,
489:   ),
490: );
491: 
492: @mixin typography($level) {
493:   $config: map-get($typography, $level);
494:   font-size: map-get($config, 'size');
495:   font-weight: map-get($config, 'weight');
496:   line-height: map-get($config, 'line-height');
497: }
498: 
499: // Usage
500: .button {
501:   @include typography('base');
502:   color: color('primary');
503:   padding: spacing('sm') spacing('md');
504: }
505: ```
506: 
507: ## Performance Best Practices
508: 
509: ### 1. **Minimize CSS Overhead**
510: 
511: ```scss
512: // ❌ Bad: Excessive nesting creates verbose selectors
513: .page {
514:   .container {
515:     .row {
516:       .column {
517:         .card {
518:           .title {
519:             font-size: 18px;
520:           }
521:         }
522:       }
523:     }
524:   }
525: }
526: 
527: // ✅ Good: Flat, maintainable selectors
528: .card__title {
529:   font-size: 18px;
530: }
531: ```
532: 
533: ### 2. **Avoid Over-Engineering**
534: 
535: ```scss
536: // ❌ Bad: Too complex
537: @mixin button-state($size, $color, $weight, $padding) {
538:   font-size: $size;
539:   color: $color;
540:   font-weight: $weight;
541:   padding: $padding;
542: }
543: 
544: // ✅ Good: Simple, focused
545: @mixin button-variant($color) {
546:   background-color: $color;
547: 
548:   &:hover {
549:     background-color: darken($color, 10%);
550:   }
551: }
552: ```
553: 
554: ### 3. **PurgeCSS/Tree-Shaking**
555: 
556: ```scss
557: // Mark as unused if not found in templates
558: /* purgecss start ignore */
559: .legacy-class {
560:   color: red;
561: }
562: /* purgecss end ignore */
563: ```
564: 
565: ## Accessibility in CSS
566: 
567: **Color Contrast:**
568: ```scss
569: // Ensure 4.5:1 ratio for normal text, 3:1 for large
570: $text-color: #000000; // dark
571: $bg-color: #ffffff;   // light
572: 
573: // Meets WCAG AA (4.5:1)
574: // Verify at: https://webaim.org/resources/contrastchecker/
575: ```
576: 
577: **Focus Indicators:**
578: ```scss
579: @mixin focus-visible {
580:   outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus);
581:   outline-offset: 2px;
582: 
583:   // Remove default focus outline
584:   &:focus-visible {
585:     outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus);
586:   }
587: }
588: 
589: button {
590:   @include focus-visible;
591: }
592: ```
593: 
594: **Reduced Motion:**
595: ```scss
596: @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
597:   * {
598:     animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
599:     animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
600:     transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
601:   }
602: }
603: ```
604: 
