579: - **ARIA Authoring Practices**: https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/
580: - **Material Design Patterns**: https://material.io/design/patterns/
581: - **WCAG 2.1 Guidelines**: https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG21/quickref/
582: - **Shopify Polaris Patterns**: https://polaris.shopify.com/patterns
583: - **Inclusive Components**: https://inclusive-components.design/
584: 
585: ## Related Skills
