<file path="memory/cross-memory-reasoning.md">
 1: # Cross Memory Reasoning
 2: 
 3: Used when a query touches multiple domains.
 4: 
 5: Example:
 6: 
 7: - code + SLA
 8: - DBA + architecture
 9: - docs + business
10: 
11: Process:
12: 
13: 1. Query each memory
14: 2. Extract relevant signals
15: 3. Merge into unified response
16: 4. If source is code, resolve symbols via CodeGraph before broad file reads
17: 5. Register reusable pattern in code-memory feedback loop
</file>

<file path="memory/mempry-registry.yml">
 1: memories:
 2:   - name: code-memory
 3:     engine: codebase-memory
 4:     retrieval_index: codegraph
 5:     requires:
 6:       - codegraph-command
 7:       - codegraph-index
 8:   - name: knowledge-memory
 9:     engine: graphify
10:   - name: enterprise-memory
11:     engine: azure-rag
12:   - name: domain-memory
13:     source: repo-registry
</file>

