<file path="techito/DESIGN_SYSTEM_QUICK_REFERENCE.md">
  1: # TechRiders Design System — Quick Reference
  2: 
  3: ## Using Design Tokens
  4: 
  5: ### Colors
  6: ```scss
  7: // Primary
  8: background-color: var(--bg-canvas);      // Page background
  9: color: var(--text-primary);              // Main text
 10: border-color: var(--border-default);     // Default borders
 11: 
 12: // States
 13: color: var(--accent-success);            // Success (green)
 14: color: var(--accent-error);              // Error (red)
 15: color: var(--accent-warning);            // Warning (orange)
 16: color: var(--accent-info);               // Info (blue)
 17: 
 18: // Dark mode (default)
 19: // Light mode: @media (prefers-color-scheme: light)
 20: ```
 21: 
 22: ### Spacing (8px grid)
 23: ```scss
 24: margin: var(--space-4);                  // 16px
 25: padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);  // 8px 16px
 26: gap: var(--space-6);                     // 24px
 27: 
 28: /* Utilities */
 29: .gap-1, .gap-2, .gap-3, .gap-4, .gap-6, .gap-8
 30: .mt-1, .mt-2, .mt-3, .mt-4, .mt-6, .mt-8
 31: .mb-1, .mb-2, .mb-3
 32: ```
 33: 
 34: ### Typography
 35: ```scss
 36: font-size: var(--font-size-base);        // 16px
 37: font-size: var(--font-size-sm);          // 14px
 38: font-size: var(--font-size-lg);          // 18px
 39: font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold); // 600
 40: 
 41: // Scale: xs (12px) → sm (14px) → base (16px) → lg (18px) → 5xl (48px)
 42: ```
 43: 
 44: ### Shadows
 45: ```scss
 46: box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);            // Medium shadow
 47: box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);            // Large shadow (hover)
 48: box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);          // Glow effect (brand blue)
 49: ```
 50: 
 51: ---
 52: 
 53: ## Using Component Classes
 54: 
 55: ### Buttons
 56: ```html
 57: <button class="btn btn-primary">Primary</button>
 58: <button class="btn btn-secondary">Secondary</button>
 59: <button class="btn btn-outline">Outline</button>
 60: <button class="btn btn-sm">Small</button>
 61: <button class="btn btn-lg">Large (touch-friendly)</button>
 62: <button class="btn is-loading">Loading...</button>
 63: <button class="btn" disabled>Disabled</button>
 64: ```
 65: 
 66: ### Forms
 67: ```html
 68: <div class="form-group">
 69:   <label for="email">Email</label>
 70:   <input 
 71:     id="email" 
 72:     type="email"
 73:     aria-describedby="email-help"
 74:     aria-required="true"
 75:   />
 76:   <p id="email-help" style="font-size: 0.875rem;">Helper text</p>
 77: </div>
 78: 
 79: <input class="is-error" aria-invalid="true" />
 80: <p role="alert" class="error-message">Error message</p>
 81: 
 82: <input class="is-success" />
 83: <p role="status" class="success-message">Success message</p>
 84: 
 85: <input readonly />
 86: ```
 87: 
 88: ### Cards
 89: ```html
 90: <div class="card">
 91:   <h3>Card Title</h3>
 92:   <p>Card content with default padding and shadow.</p>
 93: </div>
 94: 
 95: <div class="card card-compact">
 96:   <p>Compact card for dense layouts</p>
 97: </div>
 98: ```
 99: 
100: ### Badges
101: ```html
102: <span class="badge badge-info">Info</span>
103: <span class="badge badge-success">Success</span>
104: <span class="badge badge-warning">Warning</span>
105: <span class="badge badge-error">Error</span>
106: ```
107: 
108: ### Layouts
109: ```html
110: <!-- Flex layout -->
111: <div class="flex gap-4">
112:   <div style="flex: 1;">Item 1</div>
113:   <div style="flex: 1;">Item 2</div>
114: </div>
115: 
116: <!-- Grid layout (responsive) -->
117: <div class="grid grid-auto-fit">
118:   <div>Item 1</div>
119:   <div>Item 2</div>
120:   <div>Item 3</div>
121: </div>
122: 
123: <!-- 2-column (1 column on mobile) -->
124: <div class="grid grid-cols-2">
125:   <div>Col 1</div>
126:   <div>Col 2</div>
127: </div>
128: 
129: <!-- Container (max 1280px, centered) -->
130: <div class="container">
131:   <h1>Centered content</h1>
132: </div>
133: ```
134: 
135: ---
136: 
137: ## Accessibility Patterns
138: 
139: ### Forms
140: ```html
141: <!-- Always link label to input -->
142: <label for="password">Password</label>
143: <input id="password" type="password" />
144: 
145: <!-- Describe errors to screen readers -->
146: <input 
147:   aria-invalid="true"
148:   aria-describedby="pwd-error"
149: />
150: <p id="pwd-error" role="alert">Password too short</p>
151: 
152: <!-- Mark required fields -->
153: <label for="name">Full Name *</label>
154: <input 
155:   id="name"
156:   aria-required="true"
157:   required
158: />
159: ```
160: 
161: ### Buttons
162: ```html
163: <!-- Clear button names for screen readers -->
164: <button aria-label="Submit form">Send</button>
165: 
166: <!-- Loading state -->
167: <button aria-busy="true" disabled>Submitting...</button>
168: ```
169: 
170: ### Navigation
171: ```html
172: <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
173:   <a href="/" aria-current="page">Home</a>
174:   <a href="/about">About</a>
175: </nav>
176: ```
177: 
178: ### Modals
179: ```html
180: <div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="title">
181:   <h2 id="title">Modal Title</h2>
182:   <p>Modal content</p>
183:   <button>Close</button>
184: </div>
185: ```
186: 
187: ### Alerts
188: ```html
189: <!-- Announcement (intrusive) -->
190: <div role="alert" aria-live="assertive">
191:   Error: Form submission failed
192: </div>
193: 
194: <!-- Notification (non-intrusive) -->
195: <div role="status" aria-live="polite">
196:   Form saved successfully
197: </div>
198: ```
199: 
200: ---
201: 
202: ## States
203: 
204: ### Loading
205: ```html
206: <button class="is-loading">Loading...</button>
207: <!-- Shows spinner overlay, disables interaction -->
208: ```
209: 
210: ### Error
211: ```html
212: <input class="is-error" />
213: <p role="alert" class="error-message">Error text</p>
214: <!-- aria-invalid="true" automatically set by component -->
215: ```
216: 
217: ### Success
218: ```html
219: <input class="is-success" />
220: <p role="status" class="success-message">Success text</p>
221: ```
222: 
223: ### Readonly
224: ```html
225: <input readonly value="Cannot edit" />
226: <!-- Disabled appearance, but not form-disabled -->
227: ```
228: 
229: ---
230: 
231: ## Themes
232: 
233: ### Automatic (System Preference)
234: ```html
235: <!-- HTML respects OS theme automatically -->
236: <!-- Dark mode: Windows/Mac dark mode enabled -->
237: <!-- Light mode: Windows/Mac light mode enabled -->
238: <!-- No CSS changes needed -->
