  2: 
  3: **Angular 20 SPA** — Dark Navy Design System | Standalone Components | OnPush Change Detection
  4: 
  5: ---
  6: 
  7: ## 📦 Project Structure
  8: 
  9: ```
 10: techito/
 11: ├── src/
 12: │   ├── app/                    ← Angular components & services
 13: │   ├── assets/                 ← Images, fonts, static files
 14: │   ├── environments/           ← Environment configuration
 15: │   ├── design-tokens.scss      ← Single source of truth (60+ variables)
 16: │   ├── _components.scss        ← Reusable component library (20+ components)
 17: │   ├── styles.scss             ← Global styles
 18: │   └── main.ts, server.ts
 19: │
 20: ├── docs/                       ← Developer documentation
 21: │   ├── QUICK_START.md          ← How to refactor SCSS (10 min)
 22: │   ├── COMPONENTS.md           ← Component library reference
